Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.54,0:00:37.00,Default,,0,0,0,,给我乖乖待着\N{\reng}Stay down!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.05,0:00:43.92,Default,,0,0,0,,不准乱动\N{\reng}Don't move!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.80,0:00:50.55,Default,,0,0,0,,搞定\N{\reng}Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.35,0:00:59.52,Default,,0,0,0,,求救求救 这里是顽童二号\N{\reng}Mayday! Mayday! This is the Sawyer-Two.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.52,0:01:00.98,Default,,0,0,0,,我们遭遇海盗攻击\N{\reng}We're under attack by pirates.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.98,0:01:02.44,Default,,0,0,0,,请求即刻救援\N{\reng}Requesting an immediate aid.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.36,0:01:09.53,Default,,0,0,0,,大家总说每人各有特长\N{\reng}They say everybody's good at something.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.53,0:01:11.95,Default,,0,0,0,,而我 能与鱼类沟通\N{\reng}Me? I talk to fish.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.95,0:01:14.12,Default,,0,0,0,,我也因此结识好友暴风\N{\reng}That's how I met my friend, Storm.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.20,0:01:18.87,Default,,0,0,0,,我需要坐骑时它总会出现\N{\reng}He's always there when I need a lift.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.89,0:01:33.72,Default,,0,0,0,,有些人因此觉得我很搞笑 但我不在乎\N{\reng}Some people think that makes me a joke.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.72,0:01:36.47,Default,,0,0,0,,知道为什么吗 因为我还有别的强项\N{\reng}But I don't care. You know why? 'Cause I'm also good at something else.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.52,0:01:42.44,Default,,0,0,0,,那就是擅长爆头\N{\reng}And that's breaking heads.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.95,0:01:52.24,Default,,0,0,0,,老爸单挑所有海盗\N{\reng}Pow! Papa took on all the pirates.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.24,0:01:53.87,Default,,0,0,0,,我说:"你们海盗以为…"\N{\reng}I was like, "Well, the pirates think that--"
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.19,0:01:55.65,Default,,0,0,0,,- 嘿 - 呀\N{\reng}-Hi -Ya!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.70,0:01:56.91,Default,,0,0,0,,你老爸打趴他们\N{\reng}Papa kicked their butts.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.17,0:02:04.17,Default,,0,0,0,,那些杂碎根本毫无胜算\N{\reng}Those chum lickers didn't stand a chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.48,0:02:06.03,Default,,0,0,0,,哦\N{\reng}Ooh!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.34,0:02:08.13,Default,,0,0,0,,把他们打成满地找牙的猪头\N{\reng}Papa kicked their asses and took their names.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.42,0:02:10.13,Default,,0,0,0,,好耶 太棒了\N{\reng}Yeah! Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.26,0:02:13.93,Default,,0,0,0,,小心\N{\reng}Watch out.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.06,0:02:21.31,Default,,0,0,0,,抱歉老爹 是我不对\N{\reng}Sorry, Pops. My bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.77,0:02:24.48,Default,,0,0,0,,对了 那是我儿子 小亚瑟\N{\reng}Oh, yeah, this is my son, Arthur Jr.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.31,0:02:27.69,Default,,0,0,0,,四年前 我的人生完全改变\N{\reng}See, four years ago, everything changed.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.69,0:02:29.69,Default,,0,0,0,,我遇见一位美女 坠入爱河\N{\reng}I met a woman, fell in love, and the next thing I know,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.15,0:02:31.15,Default,,0,0,0,,然后转眼间…\N{\reng}we're getting married
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.15,0:02:33.78,Default,,0,0,0,,我们已结婚生子\N{\reng}and having a kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.78,0:02:36.33,Default,,0,0,0,,这个小家伙是我此生最棒的礼物\N{\reng}This little guy's the best thing that ever happened to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.00,0:02:43.00,Default,,0,0,0,,但这小子 他从不乖乖睡觉\N{\reng}But this kid, he doesn't sleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.54,0:02:46.21,Default,,0,0,0,,你尿布里面藏了什么\N{\reng}What you got in there, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.50,0:02:49.17,Default,,0,0,0,,好了…\N{\reng}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.63,0:02:52.30,Default,,0,0,0,,而且他总是命中目标\N{\reng}And he never misses.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.93,0:02:53.76,Default,,0,0,0,,搞什么…\N{\reng}What the...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.76,0:02:54.84,Default,,0,0,0,,所以我总是超早起床\N{\reng}And then, I'm up at the crack of dawn
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.84,0:02:57.68,Default,,0,0,0,,因为除了结婚生子之外\N{\reng}because on top of getting married and having a kid...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.68,0:02:59.22,Default,,0,0,0,,我还终于找到一份工作\N{\reng}I finally got a job.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.64,0:03:01.48,Default,,0,0,0,,没错\N{\reng}That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.48,0:03:04.10,Default,,0,0,0,,在下正是亚特兰提斯之王\N{\reng}I'm the king of freaking Atlantis.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.94,0:03:08.27,Default,,0,0,0,,知道我是怎么坐上这位置的\N{\reng}How did I score that, you asked?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.40,0:03:12.95,Default,,0,0,0,,我阻止我小弟欧姆攻击陆地世界\N{\reng}Well, I stopped my brother, Orm, from attacking the surface world.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.45,0:03:15.95,Default,,0,0,0,,在过程中 我剥夺了他的王位\N{\reng}And in doing so, I claimed the throne from him.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.37,0:03:18.49,Default,,0,0,0,,一开始我以为\N{\reng}At first I was all like...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.49,0:03:20.04,Default,,0,0,0,,好耶\N{\reng}Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.16,0:03:23.12,Default,,0,0,0,,领海的掌控权以前都是…\N{\reng}The territorial waters are long held...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.12,0:03:26.33,Default,,0,0,0,,然后我发现当国王其实没那么好玩\N{\reng}But then, as it turned out,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.33,0:03:28.50,Default,,0,0,0,,我想提醒涅罗斯国王…\N{\reng}being king wasn't all it was cracked up to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.50,0:03:31.17,Default,,0,0,0,,整天有开不完的政治会议\N{\reng}It's just meetings all day and politics.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.17,0:03:33.30,Default,,0,0,0,,快无聊死了 我都不知道对着盐海国王时\N{\reng}I'm so bored, I don't even know which end of the Brine King
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.30,0:03:34.97,Default,,0,0,0,,眼睛该往哪看\N{\reng}I'm supposed to be looking at half the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.01,0:03:39.76,Default,,0,0,0,,好耶 真是太赞了\N{\reng}Whoo!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.76,0:03:41.18,Default,,0,0,0,,好像这还不够糟糕\N{\reng}Yeah! That was awesome! And if that's not bad enough,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.18,0:03:43.48,Default,,0,0,0,,我更发现还有一个以前没人\N{\reng}turns out there's this whole Council of Houses thing
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.48,0:03:44.89,Default,,0,0,0,,跟我提过的众议院\N{\reng}that nobody told me about.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.89,0:03:47.44,Default,,0,0,0,,他们有权否决所有我想做的事\N{\reng}Which basically gets to shoot down everything I want to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.61,0:03:50.23,Default,,0,0,0,,还好有我的小家伙作伴\N{\reng}The only thing that makes all the hard work
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.23,0:03:53.32,Default,,0,0,0,,才不枉我那份苦差事和不眠夜\N{\reng}and sleepless nights worthwhile is hanging with my little man.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.61,0:03:55.82,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿！你没射中\N{\reng}Hey!You missed me!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.08,0:04:01.91,Default,,0,0,0,,当然这工作也有好玩的地方\N{\reng}But of course, there are fun parts of the job.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.66,0:04:08.08,Default,,0,0,0,,我得以用我的方式来维持海洋安全\N{\reng}Whoa! I get to keep the sea safe the best way I know how.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.13,0:04:14.72,Default,,0,0,0,,特别是我还破获了几个非法铁笼格斗\N{\reng}Especially when I get to take down an illegal cage fight or two.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.47,0:04:24.23,Default,,0,0,0,,但不管我有多成功 还是会搞砸一些小事\N{\reng}But for everything I get right, something else gets screwed up.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.94,0:04:35.86,Default,,0,0,0,,喵的…\N{\reng}Ah, fu--
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.26,0:05:03.76,Default,,0,0,0,,- 好耶 - 给你\N{\reng}-Oh, yeah. -Here you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.25,0:05:10.72,Default,,0,0,0,,干杯\N{\reng}Slainte.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.23,0:05:18.13,Default,,0,0,0,,所以…\N{\reng}So...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.45,0:05:21.07,Default,,0,0,0,,他会需要手足来陪他玩\N{\reng}he's gonna need a little brother or sister to play with.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.29,0:05:26.70,Default,,0,0,0,,他有一只狗\N{\reng}He's got a dog.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.33,0:05:28.83,Default,,0,0,0,,我是认真的\N{\reng}Hey, I'm serious.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.25,0:05:33.25,Default,,0,0,0,,我亲眼看到你小时候有多寂寞\N{\reng}I saw how lonely it was for you growing up.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.25,0:05:34.75,Default,,0,0,0,,身为独生子\N{\reng}An only child.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.42,0:05:38.67,Default,,0,0,0,,我很遗憾没能给你更多手足\N{\reng}I always regretted I couldn't give you that.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.59,0:05:41.89,Default,,0,0,0,,别对自己太严苛\N{\reng}Yeah, well, don't be too hard on yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.89,0:05:45.26,Default,,0,0,0,,结果我有个继弟 却是个混帐\N{\reng}Turns out I have a brother and he's a total dick bag.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.56,0:05:46.56,Default,,0,0,0,,别这样\N{\reng}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.56,0:05:51.15,Default,,0,0,0,,你跟欧姆的关系是特殊案例\N{\reng}Your relationship with Orm isn't how it usually is.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.15,0:05:56.94,Default,,0,0,0,,兄弟姐妹吵架很正常 但大家总归是家人\N{\reng}Sure, siblings bicker and fight but at the end of the day, they're family.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.44,0:06:00.99,Default,,0,0,0,,必要时应该能指望他们帮忙\N{\reng}You should be able to count on them for help.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.28,0:06:05.70,Default,,0,0,0,,是喔 若要找帮手我还是宁愿选狗\N{\reng}Yeah, well, I'll still take the dog over him any day.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.96,0:06:13.50,Default,,0,0,0,,喂 你快看\N{\reng}Hey, look at that.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.76,0:06:25.26,Default,,0,0,0,,不是吧\N{\reng}Holy crap.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.10,0:06:35.36,Default,,0,0,0,,小宝贝 你是在跟鱼说话吗\N{\reng}Hi, baby boy. Are you talking to the fishies?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.44,0:06:41.99,Default,,0,0,0,,天啊老爹 这太让我惊喜了\N{\reng}Oh, man. Pops, this is blowing my mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.03,0:06:46.12,Default,,0,0,0,,我这辈子都希望能跟人分享这天赋\N{\reng}My whole life I've wanted to share this gift with someone.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.12,0:06:50.75,Default,,0,0,0,,儿子 你和我 我们与众不同 我们很特别\N{\reng}Yeah, but you and me, son, we're different. We're special.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.08,0:06:54.33,Default,,0,0,0,,我们是陆地与海洋间的桥梁\N{\reng}We're connected to the land and the sea.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.33,0:06:58.55,Default,,0,0,0,,我等不及要介绍你认识 世上所有神奇生物\N{\reng}I can't wait to introduce you to all the majestic creatures on our planet.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.09,0:07:01.34,Default,,0,0,0,,让你知道这世界能有多棒\N{\reng}And show you how awesome this world can be.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.34,0:07:03.51,Default,,0,0,0,,对 你我一起\N{\reng}Yeah, you and me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.23,0:08:02.99,Default,,0,0,0,,我交叉比对了沈博士的座标 结果一无所获\N{\reng}I cross-referenced the coordinates from Dr. Shin.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.99,0:08:05.53,Default,,0,0,0,,还是没能在冰下找到亚特兰提斯遗迹\N{\reng}Nothing. Still no sign of Atlantean remnants under the ice.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.07,0:08:08.82,Default,,0,0,0,,看来他又带我们白跑一趟了\N{\reng}Looks like he's led us on another wild goose chase.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.34,0:08:31.10,Default,,0,0,0,,只要我一天不修好动力装甲 海王就能多苟活一天\N{\reng}Every day I don't fix my power suit is another day Aquaman gets to live.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.10,0:08:36.56,Default,,0,0,0,,再查一次\N{\reng}Check again.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.35,0:08:39.77,Default,,0,0,0,,这次很接近了 我有预感\N{\reng}We're close this time. I can feel it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.99,0:08:51.91,Default,,0,0,0,,探险日志第463日 史蒂芬沈博士录音\N{\reng}Expedition log day 463, Dr. Stephen Shin recording.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.91,0:08:55.54,Default,,0,0,0,,为了寻找亚特兰提斯 我走遍了全世界\N{\reng}My quest for Atlantis has brought me to the ends of the earth.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.54,0:08:57.96,Default,,0,0,0,,大卫·凯恩逐渐失去耐心\N{\reng}David Kane is losing his patience.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.58,0:09:02.09,Default,,0,0,0,,若我不尽快找到他想要的 亚特兰提斯科技\N{\reng}If I don't turn up the Atlantean technology he's looking for soon,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.09,0:09:04.59,Default,,0,0,0,,他们大概会…\N{\reng}they're probably going to... um...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.88,0:09:10.76,Default,,0,0,0,,还是不提那个了 我相信一切都会顺利的\N{\reng}You know what, let's not even go there. I'm sure everything will be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.77,0:09:24.65,Default,,0,0,0,,沈博士 快来看\N{\reng}Dr. Shin, take a look at this.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.44,0:09:27.19,Default,,0,0,0,,拜托告诉我你有线索了\N{\reng}Please tell me you found something.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.74,0:09:29.53,Default,,0,0,0,,地震仪上的读数超扯的\N{\reng}Seismic array is going crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.53,0:09:30.87,Default,,0,0,0,,震央在哪\N{\reng}Where's the epicenter?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.82,0:09:33.20,Default,,0,0,0,,就在我们脚下\N{\reng}We're standing on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.35,0:09:57.35,Default,,0,0,0,,快逃啊\N{\reng}Run!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.82,0:10:48.36,Default,,0,0,0,,发生什么事了 是地震吗\N{\reng}What just happened? An earthquake?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.36,0:10:51.53,Default,,0,0,0,,不是 应该是一片冰盖脱落了\N{\reng}No. I think it was a piece of ice sheet breaking off.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.53,0:11:30.78,Default,,0,0,0,,快点 站起来\N{\reng}Come on. Get up.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.07,0:11:35.03,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我的脚踝好像断了 - 快点 我们走\N{\reng}-I think I broke my ankle! -Come on. Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.03,0:11:37.37,Default,,0,0,0,,快点起来 我们得走了\N{\reng}Come on, get up. Go, we gotta go! We gotta go!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.54,0:11:41.50,Default,,0,0,0,,快点 我们得离开 快点\N{\reng}Come on, we gotta move! Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.22,0:12:03.77,Default,,0,0,0,,拜托 拜托 救我\N{\reng}Please, please. No, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.77,0:12:05.39,Default,,0,0,0,,救我 拜托 别放手\N{\reng}Help, please! Don't let go!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.26,0:12:38.05,Default,,0,0,0,,你发生什么事了\N{\reng}What the hell happened to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.76,0:12:41.60,Default,,0,0,0,,那后面有恐怖的东西\N{\reng}There's something back there.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.86,0:12:57.53,Default,,0,0,0,,太神奇了\N{\reng}Astounding.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.53,0:13:00.62,Default,,0,0,0,,读数显示下面有东西\N{\reng}My readings show something's down here.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.62,0:13:03.62,Default,,0,0,0,,尺寸大到可能是亚特兰提斯船舰\N{\reng}And it's definitely big enough to be an Atlantean ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.62,0:13:06.87,Default,,0,0,0,,若真的是 就可能在上面 找到能修理你动力装甲的科技\N{\reng}If it is, we might be able to scavenge the tech you need to fix your suit.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.79,0:13:10.25,Default,,0,0,0,,这地方怎么可能真实存在\N{\reng}How is this place even possible?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.63,0:13:14.30,Default,,0,0,0,,在地球持续升温前 这里应该被冰封了\N{\reng}This was all probably solid ice until we started heating the planet.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.59,0:13:18.76,Default,,0,0,0,,感谢温室效应 对吧\N{\reng}Well, thank God for global warming, am I right?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.76,0:13:21.76,Default,,0,0,0,,那个 应该不算什么好事\N{\reng}Uh, yeah, that's not exactly a good thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.57,0:13:41.32,Default,,0,0,0,,足迹都往下走\N{\reng}The tracks lead down there.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.03,0:13:44.16,Default,,0,0,0,,穿上装备\N{\reng}Suit up.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.08,0:13:47.25,Default,,0,0,0,,等等 足迹都往下走\N{\reng}Wait. The tracks lead down there,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.25,0:13:50.79,Default,,0,0,0,,意思是怪兽也在下面\N{\reng}which means the monster's down there.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.46,0:13:58.55,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧 我猜我们要下去\N{\reng}Okay. I guess we're going down there.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.91,0:14:25.41,Default,,0,0,0,,太不可思议了\N{\reng}I don't believe this.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.95,0:14:28.87,Default,,0,0,0,,这是某种建物\N{\reng}It's a structure of some kind.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.00,0:14:32.04,Default,,0,0,0,,冰里埋藏着更多东西\N{\reng}And there's more buried in the ice.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.79,0:14:35.21,Default,,0,0,0,,本来以为我们只会找到船舰\N{\reng}Here I thought we were just going to find a ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.05,0:14:39.51,Default,,0,0,0,,- 所有人 散开搜寻 - 收到\N{\reng}-Everyone, fan out and search. -Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.51,0:14:42.47,Default,,0,0,0,,我们侥幸撞见大发现了 博士\N{\reng}We've stumbled upon something big here, doc.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.85,0:14:48.31,Default,,0,0,0,,这肯定有几千年的历史\N{\reng}This has to be a few thousand years old.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.60,0:14:50.06,Default,,0,0,0,,太神奇了\N{\reng}Astounding.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.77,0:14:58.24,Default,,0,0,0,,喔\N{\reng}Whoa.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.01,0:15:00.28,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯\N{\reng}Uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.85,0:15:41.85,Default,,0,0,0,,哦…\N{\reng}Ow...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.04,0:15:59.80,Default,,0,0,0,,这到底是什么地方\N{\reng}What is this place?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.59,0:16:06.30,Default,,0,0,0,,终于 你找到这里了\N{\reng}At last, you are here.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.83,0:16:39.29,Default,,0,0,0,,将我从监禁中释放\N{\reng}Free me from my prison
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.29,0:16:42.30,Default,,0,0,0,,我就会赐予你力量\N{\reng}and I will grant you the strength
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.30,0:16:45.97,Default,,0,0,0,,好杀死谋害你父亲之人\N{\reng}to kill the man who murdered your father.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.34,0:16:47.84,Default,,0,0,0,,你不能这样丢下他\N{\reng}You can't leave him like this!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.84,0:16:49.93,Default,,0,0,0,,自己去跟大海求饶吧\N{\reng}You ask the sea for mercy.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.93,0:16:54.35,Default,,0,0,0,,快走 你得活下去 才能杀了那个混帐\N{\reng}Get out of here! You need to live so you can kill that son of a bitch!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.35,0:16:58.85,Default,,0,0,0,,你会夺回他剥夺你的一切\N{\reng}You will take from him what he stole from you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.27,0:17:03.78,Default,,0,0,0,,让他的家园燃烧\N{\reng}His home will burn
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.78,0:17:08.82,Default,,0,0,0,,让他的王国在我的军团前瓦解\N{\reng}and his kingdom will fall before my legions.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.81,0:17:16.41,Default,,0,0,0,,哦…\N{\reng}Whoa, whoa, whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.79,0:17:17.96,Default,,0,0,0,,大卫 不要 大卫\N{\reng}David. No, David.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.96,0:17:18.87,Default,,0,0,0,,大卫\N{\reng}David! Whoa! Whoa! Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.67,0:17:21.75,Default,,0,0,0,,大卫 大卫 没事的\N{\reng}David. David, it's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.75,0:17:23.05,Default,,0,0,0,,你没事\N{\reng}You're all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.84,0:17:26.84,Default,,0,0,0,,那是什么鬼东西\N{\reng}What the hell is that thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.15,0:17:44.65,Default,,0,0,0,,世界各地传来惊人影像\N{\reng}Coming in from all around the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.65,0:17:45.65,Default,,0,0,0,,各位观众晚安\N{\reng}Good evening,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.65,0:17:48.65,Default,,0,0,0,,过去五个月来 世界各地\N{\reng}folks. ...Just unbelievable footage In the past five months,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.65,0:17:51.03,Default,,0,0,0,,都传来破纪录的升温\N{\reng}we've seen an extraordinary rise in temperatures reported around the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.03,0:17:55.29,Default,,0,0,0,,也因此导致许多前所未见的极端气候\N{\reng}And that has resulted in some of the wildest weather we've ever seen.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.29,0:17:58.87,Default,,0,0,0,,是的 在德州达拉斯发生了雷雪\N{\reng}Yes, this is thundersnow in Dallas, Texas.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.87,0:18:02.92,Default,,0,0,0,,能见度趋近零 今晚预计的降雪量\N{\reng}Visibility is near zero and there's more snow expected tonight
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.92,0:18:06.01,Default,,0,0,0,,会超过达拉斯往常全年总和\N{\reng}than Dallas usually sees in an entire year.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.01,0:18:08.92,Default,,0,0,0,,这仅是全球气候异象的一小部分\N{\reng}It's only one part of a worldwide weather phenomenon
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.92,0:18:11.80,Default,,0,0,0,,完全是前所未见\N{\reng}unlike anything we've ever seen before.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.39,0:18:18.39,Default,,0,0,0,,亚瑟\N{\reng}Arthur.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.85,0:18:24.06,Default,,0,0,0,,议院召开紧急会议\N{\reng}The Council's called for an emergency gathering.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.61,0:18:26.57,Default,,0,0,0,,又爆发另一起瘟疫\N{\reng}There's been another plague outbreak.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.19,0:18:31.36,Default,,0,0,0,,连科学家都无法解释\N{\reng}...scientists are at a loss to explain.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.36,0:18:33.32,Default,,0,0,0,,但真正的问题是\N{\reng}But the real question is,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.32,0:18:37.37,Default,,0,0,0,,这还会持续多长时间 气温最后又会有多热\N{\reng}how long will it continue? And how much hotter is it going to get?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.21,0:18:41.87,Default,,0,0,0,,这次是在哪里爆发\N{\reng}Where did it hit this time?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.83,0:18:44.92,Default,,0,0,0,,亚特兰提斯的第九区\N{\reng}The Ninth Tride of Atlantis,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.92,0:18:48.96,Default,,0,0,0,,现在人鱼王国也传出疫情\N{\reng}and there are now reports of outbreaks in the Fishermen Kingdom as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.96,0:18:51.76,Default,,0,0,0,,已经好几世纪没有这样的疫情\N{\reng}There haven't been outbreaks like this in centuries.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.76,0:18:52.84,Default,,0,0,0,,为何会现在出现\N{\reng}Why now?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.84,0:18:57.10,Default,,0,0,0,,海洋酸化、溶氧量降低、毒性藻华\N{\reng}Increased ocean acidity, decreased oxygen levels, toxic algal blooms.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.10,0:18:59.02,Default,,0,0,0,,原因任君选择\N{\reng}Take your pick.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.02,0:19:03.81,Default,,0,0,0,,陆地居民过去一世纪以来 不断戕害我们环境\N{\reng}The surface has been poisoning our atmosphere for over a century.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.69,0:19:06.61,Default,,0,0,0,,若他们不清楚我们的存在\N{\reng}You can't expect them to care about what happens to us
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.61,0:19:08.53,Default,,0,0,0,,又怎能奢望他们关心我们的处境\N{\reng}if they don't even know we exist.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.36,0:19:10.95,Default,,0,0,0,,若我们想开始交涉协调\N{\reng}If you want to be a part of the conversation,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.95,0:19:13.28,Default,,0,0,0,,就得先站出来发声\N{\reng}we have to take our seat at the table.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.62,0:19:21.54,Default,,0,0,0,,是时候让亚特兰提斯 在陆地世界前现身了\N{\reng}It's time for Atlantis to reveal itself to the surface.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.75,0:19:28.71,Default,,0,0,0,,陛下应该很清楚议院对此举的看法\N{\reng}Your majesty is well aware of the Council's position on this.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.71,0:19:31.97,Default,,0,0,0,,听着 我们可以与人类科学家沟通 结合双方科技\N{\reng}Listen, we can talk to their scientists
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.97,0:19:34.05,Default,,0,0,0,,来扭转他们所造成的损害\N{\reng}and combine our technologies to reverse the damage that they've already done.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.89,0:19:39.31,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道这有违我们传统 但这世界正逐渐缩小\N{\reng}And I know this is against our traditions, but the world is shrinking,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.31,0:19:41.64,Default,,0,0,0,,传统作法已无法保护我们\N{\reng}And the old ways aren't gonna protect us anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.94,0:19:44.56,Default,,0,0,0,,时代已经改变\N{\reng}Times have changed.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.35,0:19:46.94,Default,,0,0,0,,亚特兰提斯渴望改变\N{\reng}Atlantis wants this.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.94,0:19:49.82,Default,,0,0,0,,许多新世代已不愿再躲藏\N{\reng}There's a whole generation out there
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.82,0:19:53.15,Default,,0,0,0,,你难道忘了正是这种瘟疫\N{\reng}that don't want to hide anymore. Have you already forgotten that this plague
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.15,0:19:56.16,Default,,0,0,0,,害死了你最敬爱的导师\N{\reng}killed your own beloved mentor,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.16,0:19:59.70,Default,,0,0,0,,你现在竟然会想与他们和谈\N{\reng}and you want to negotiate with them?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.70,0:20:04.21,Default,,0,0,0,,我们赋予你小弟战争权与海洋领主的称号不是没有原因的\N{\reng}We gave your brother war powers and made him Ocean Master for a reason.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.87,0:20:08.92,Default,,0,0,0,,若我们想让陆地居民知道我们的存在\N{\reng}If we ever decide to make ourselves known to the surface-dwellers,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.92,0:20:12.97,Default,,0,0,0,,会是为了歼灭他们 而不是共存\N{\reng}it will be to eradicate them, not to co-exist.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.58,0:20:43.29,Default,,0,0,0,,厉害吧\N{\reng}Hey, not bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.37,0:20:48.04,Default,,0,0,0,,我以前哄你睡觉得花两倍时间\N{\reng}Used to take me twice as long to get you to go to sleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.04,0:20:49.88,Default,,0,0,0,,真不知你是怎么办到的 老爸\N{\reng}I don't know how you did it, Pops.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.88,0:20:52.05,Default,,0,0,0,,梅拉与我有整个王国帮助\N{\reng}Mera and I have the whole kingdom helping us,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.05,0:20:54.47,Default,,0,0,0,,但这小家伙还是快把我们整死了\N{\reng}but that little baby boy is still kicking our asses.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.84,0:20:55.88,Default,,0,0,0,,而你\N{\reng}And you...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.05,0:21:00.18,Default,,0,0,0,,独自照顾我 扶养我长大\N{\reng}taking care of me, raising me on your own...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.89,0:21:06.60,Default,,0,0,0,,你才是真正的超级英雄\N{\reng}You're the real superhero.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.56,0:21:11.11,Default,,0,0,0,,- 敬单亲父母  - 嗯\N{\reng}-To single parents. -Mmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.94,0:21:17.24,Default,,0,0,0,,毕竟我的工作没有你的那么高压\N{\reng}Well, my job was a little less stressful than yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.24,0:21:19.95,Default,,0,0,0,,是喔 但我这工作干得糟透了\N{\reng}Yeah, well, I just plain suck at my job.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.83,0:21:23.29,Default,,0,0,0,,武尔科嘱咐我要促进海洋与陆地团结\N{\reng}Vulko told me to bring the land and the sea together.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.45,0:21:28.87,Default,,0,0,0,,问题是亚特兰提斯 有半数人仍想摧毁陆地\N{\reng}The problem is half of Atlantis still wants to destroy the surface.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.87,0:21:31.25,Default,,0,0,0,,他们拒绝沟通 我什么也推动不了\N{\reng}They won't listen. I can't bring shit together.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.25,0:21:34.38,Default,,0,0,0,,武尔科相信你 是吧\N{\reng}Vulko believed in you. Aye.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.38,0:21:35.76,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道\N{\reng}I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.05,0:21:39.30,Default,,0,0,0,,我想念他\N{\reng}I miss him.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.47,0:21:43.47,Default,,0,0,0,,喂\N{\reng}Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.52,0:21:47.81,Default,,0,0,0,,你无法拯救每一个人 儿子\N{\reng}You can't save them all, son.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.56,0:21:52.15,Default,,0,0,0,,你想知道我是怎么独自养大你的\N{\reng}You really want to know how I raised you here by myself?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.82,0:21:55.32,Default,,0,0,0,,我只是埋头苦干\N{\reng}I just kept going.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.65,0:21:59.41,Default,,0,0,0,,事情顺利时欢庆 失败时则记取教训\N{\reng}You celebrate the wins, you mourn the losses.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.95,0:22:02.45,Default,,0,0,0,,隔天醒来继续加油\N{\reng}And you wake up the next day and you do it again.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.45,0:22:07.12,Default,,0,0,0,,有时最勇敢的举动就是永不放弃\N{\reng}Sometimes not giving up is the most heroic thing you can do.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.10,0:23:08.56,Default,,0,0,0,,人体构造先天就不该去适应这种深度\N{\reng}Humans were not made to live at these depths.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.68,0:23:11.35,Default,,0,0,0,,别担心这点\N{\reng}Yeah, don't worry about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.98,0:23:14.31,Default,,0,0,0,,你只需记得这艘船是谁打造的\N{\reng}You just remember who built this ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.81,0:23:17.61,Default,,0,0,0,,我比较担心是他们多久前建的\N{\reng}I'm more worried about how long ago they built it.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.28,0:23:21.95,Default,,0,0,0,,已迫近目标 开启隐形模式\N{\reng}We're coming up on it. Engage stealth mode.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.75,0:23:40.13,Default,,0,0,0,,喂 博士\N{\reng}Hey, doc.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.42,0:23:43.76,Default,,0,0,0,,快去你那座大炮旁备战\N{\reng}You stand ready with that big gun of yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.19,0:23:57.52,Default,,0,0,0,,探险日志第613天\N{\reng}Expedition log, day 613.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.52,0:24:00.11,Default,,0,0,0,,凯恩踏上我们此行最危险的任务\N{\reng}Kane is off on our most dangerous mission yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.11,0:24:02.95,Default,,0,0,0,,一个三人的八爪机舰渗透小组\N{\reng}A three man octobot infiltration team.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.07,0:24:07.28,Default,,0,0,0,,我们寻获的这些远古机械太神奇了\N{\reng}It's incredible that these ancient machines we found
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.28,0:24:09.54,Default,,0,0,0,,这么多年后仍运作如常\N{\reng}still function after all these years.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.54,0:24:12.08,Default,,0,0,0,,我仅为符合需求稍加改造\N{\reng}All I did was retrofit them to our needs.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.08,0:24:15.92,Default,,0,0,0,,但它们需要一种特殊燃料维持运转\N{\reng}But they require a very specialized fuel to keep them running.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.92,0:24:18.54,Default,,0,0,0,,凯恩称之为奥利哈钢\N{\reng}Kane calls it orichalcum.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.54,0:24:20.38,Default,,0,0,0,,我不知道他这些知识都是从哪学来的\N{\reng}I don't know how he knows about this,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.38,0:24:23.09,Default,,0,0,0,,但从他寻获三叉戟那日就是如此\N{\reng}but it all started the day he found that trident.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.09,0:24:26.09,Default,,0,0,0,,突然间他精通以前无从了解的秘辛\N{\reng}Suddenly, he knows secrets that he couldn't possibly know,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.09,0:24:29.01,Default,,0,0,0,,包括取得奥利哈钢的唯一管道\N{\reng}including the only way to obtain this orichalcum
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.01,0:24:32.10,Default,,0,0,0,,就是要从那些高度警戒的贮存场掠夺\N{\reng}is to steal it from highly-protected storage vaults.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.10,0:24:34.94,Default,,0,0,0,,我们即将打劫其中最危险的一处\N{\reng}And we're about to hit the most dangerous one of them all.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.07,0:25:23.44,Default,,0,0,0,,好 你有15分钟的作业时间\N{\reng}Okay, you have 15 minutes to get in and out.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.78,0:25:26.53,Default,,0,0,0,,没有犯错的空间\N{\reng}No margin for error.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.88,0:25:42.84,Default,,0,0,0,,从这走应能让你直接抵达\N{\reng}Yeah, this should take you through.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.77,0:25:58.48,Default,,0,0,0,,我们不希望发生正面冲突\N{\reng}We don't want any confrontation.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:58.48,0:26:01.06,Default,,0,0,0,,大卫 我们无法对抗他们整个大军\N{\reng}David, we can't fight their entire army.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.16,0:26:19.08,Default,,0,0,0,,保持警戒\N{\reng}Stay vigilant.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.08,0:26:22.21,Default,,0,0,0,,我们不清楚他们有何种的防御机制\N{\reng}We have no idea what kind of security measures they have down there.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:48.36,0:26:49.65,Default,,0,0,0,,开始提取\N{\reng}Commencing extraction.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:50.86,0:26:53.53,Default,,0,0,0,,小心点 这东西易燃易爆\N{\reng}Be careful. It's highly volatile.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:01.12,0:27:02.71,Default,,0,0,0,,开始装载驳船\N{\reng}Loading barge now.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:20.60,0:27:23.65,Default,,0,0,0,,刺魟 改变计划\N{\reng}Stingray, change of plans.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:23.65,0:27:25.40,Default,,0,0,0,,我需要即刻协助撤离\N{\reng}I need an extraction now!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:26.27,0:27:28.61,Default,,0,0,0,,全体进入备战状态\N{\reng}All hands to battle stations.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:02.39,0:28:03.73,Default,,0,0,0,,太神奇了\N{\reng}Astounding.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:08.57,0:28:10.65,Default,,0,0,0,,不明入侵船舰请注意\N{\reng}Attention, unidentified vessel.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:10.65,0:28:13.36,Default,,0,0,0,,- 这里不是过境区域 - 博士\N{\reng}You are out of the transit zone.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:13.36,0:28:14.95,Default,,0,0,0,,快点开启音波电池充电\N{\reng}Doctor, power up the sonic battery.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:14.95,0:28:16.74,Default,,0,0,0,,非法越境将遭受\N{\reng}Illegal border crossing will be met with deadly force.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:16.74,0:28:18.74,Default,,0,0,0,,- 致命武力打击 - 现在\N{\reng}Now!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:21.25,0:28:22.66,Default,,0,0,0,,开始充电\N{\reng}Commencing charge.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:29.25,0:28:31.84,Default,,0,0,0,,边防检查管制 入侵者逼近\N{\reng}Border Control, intruder approaching.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:31.84,0:28:34.09,Default,,0,0,0,,武装高压水炮并锁定目标\N{\reng}Arm hydro cannon and lock target.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:34.09,0:28:36.59,Default,,0,0,0,,前边境大门高压水炮已锁定目标\N{\reng}Hydro cannon at front border gate locking in on target.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:36.59,0:28:38.14,Default,,0,0,0,,充电率已设定为最大功率\N{\reng}Chargers set to maximum power.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:41.52,0:28:42.73,Default,,0,0,0,,入侵者现身\N{\reng}Intruder in sight.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:42.73,0:28:44.10,Default,,0,0,0,,消灭他们\N{\reng}Take them out!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:48.27,0:28:51.94,Default,,0,0,0,,你们在等什么 开火啊\N{\reng}What are you waiting for? Fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:22.89,0:29:25.14,Default,,0,0,0,,长官 亚特兰提斯敌军正在逼近\N{\reng}Sir, Atlantean hostiles are approaching.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:25.73,0:29:27.94,Default,,0,0,0,,分头行动 自行前往撤离点\N{\reng}Split up. Make your way to the extraction point.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:27.94,0:29:29.06,Default,,0,0,0,,收到\N{\reng}Roger.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:29.44,0:29:32.19,Default,,0,0,0,,他们抢了贮存场 我们不能让他们跑了\N{\reng}They've raided the storage vault.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:32.48,0:29:35.07,Default,,0,0,0,,别担心 他们跑不了 我来追击\N{\reng}We can't let them get away. Don't worry, they won't. I'm on this one.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:49.38,0:29:52.46,Default,,0,0,0,,暂停开火 他们在穿越夜市\N{\reng}Hold your fire! They're cutting through the Night Market.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:52.46,0:29:54.46,Default,,0,0,0,,小心路人安全\N{\reng}Watch out for the civilians.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:48.89,0:30:52.81,Default,,0,0,0,,警告 警告 非法进入超管区\N{\reng}Warning. Warning. Illegal entrance into hypertube.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:52.81,0:30:55.52,Default,,0,0,0,,超越600节最高限速\N{\reng}Exceeding maximum speed of 600 knots.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:55.52,0:30:57.57,Default,,0,0,0,,即刻减速\N{\reng}Reduce speed immediately.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:43.70,0:31:44.62,Default,,0,0,0,,惨了\N{\reng}Oh, shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:00.88,0:32:02.88,Default,,0,0,0,,大卫 我们已抵达撤离点\N{\reng}David, we're here at the extraction point.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:02.88,0:32:04.84,Default,,0,0,0,,奥利哈钢已到手并安好\N{\reng}The orichalcum is onboard and secure. Come on,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:04.84,0:32:06.22,Default,,0,0,0,,快点 我们走了\N{\reng}let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:06.22,0:32:07.30,Default,,0,0,0,,不 还不行\N{\reng}Not yet!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:07.30,0:32:09.60,Default,,0,0,0,,我要先杀几个人鱼再走\N{\reng}I'm gonna kill me a dead mermaid.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:21.19,0:32:23.36,Default,,0,0,0,,离我老婆远点\N{\reng}Get away from my wife!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:25.03,0:32:26.45,Default,,0,0,0,,你老婆\N{\reng}Your wife?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:26.45,0:32:28.91,Default,,0,0,0,,你先是夺走小弟的王位\N{\reng}First you steal your brother's throne,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:28.91,0:32:30.83,Default,,0,0,0,,然后连他女人都抢了\N{\reng}then you steal his woman?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:31.20,0:32:34.17,Default,,0,0,0,,海王 你真可耻\N{\reng}Aquaman, shame on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:41.34,0:32:42.76,Default,,0,0,0,,大卫 我们得闪了\N{\reng}Uh, David, we gotta go.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:42.76,0:32:44.84,Default,,0,0,0,,整个亚特兰提斯大军正往这赶来\N{\reng}The entire Atlantean army is headed this way.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:44.84,0:32:46.84,Default,,0,0,0,,若我们不现在离开 就死定了\N{\reng}If we don't leave now, we're dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:34.73,0:33:36.35,Default,,0,0,0,,左舷20度\N{\reng}Twenty degrees port!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:52.54,0:33:54.29,Default,,0,0,0,,发射音波炮\N{\reng}Fire the sonic cannon!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:54.95,0:33:56.12,Default,,0,0,0,,快啊 老沈\N{\reng}Come on, Shin!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:10.01,0:34:13.26,Default,,0,0,0,,凯鲨夫人在高级议院召开紧急会议\N{\reng}Lady Karshon has called an emergency session of the High Council
Dialogue: 0,0:34:13.26,0:34:17.48,Default,,0,0,0,,以讨论剥夺王座行政权力的动议\N{\reng}to discuss a motion that would strip the throne of its executive power.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:17.48,0:34:21.27,Default,,0,0,0,,王座本该是亚特兰提斯的根本\N{\reng}The throne is the heart of Atlantis.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:21.98,0:34:24.53,Default,,0,0,0,,然而王座现在却经常空虚\N{\reng}Too often now it stands empty,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:24.53,0:34:28.15,Default,,0,0,0,,只因国王有一半时间在陆地游荡\N{\reng}while our king spends half his time on land.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:28.53,0:34:32.32,Default,,0,0,0,,现在他在陆地的仇家更尾随他回家\N{\reng}And now his surface world enemies have followed him home.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:32.91,0:34:37.96,Default,,0,0,0,,若亚特兰提斯在世人面前现身\N{\reng}This tragedy is merely a taste of the havoc that will be wrought,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:37.96,0:34:41.71,Default,,0,0,0,,这次的悲剧只会是冰山一角\N{\reng}if Atlantis ever becomes known to the surface.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:41.71,0:34:45.25,Default,,0,0,0,,因为若他连自己家人都保护不了\N{\reng}Because if he cannot protect his own family,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:45.25,0:34:48.34,Default,,0,0,0,,又如何能保护我们\N{\reng}how is he supposed to protect us?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:55.68,0:34:58.98,Default,,0,0,0,,他跟之前不同 也更为强大\N{\reng}He's different now. He's stronger than before.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:58.98,0:35:01.23,Default,,0,0,0,,连不穿动力装甲都能跟我对打\N{\reng}And he can fight me without the power suit.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:01.23,0:35:03.40,Default,,0,0,0,,他那些新武器又是从哪来的\N{\reng}And where the hell did he get all the new toys from?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:03.40,0:35:07.23,Default,,0,0,0,,那些科技看起来很古老 但我们从未见过\N{\reng}The technology seems ancient, but we've never seen anything like it.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:07.23,0:35:11.41,Default,,0,0,0,,他使用的武器射出某种超音波能量\N{\reng}That weapon he used fires some kind of ultrasonic energy
Dialogue: 0,0:35:11.41,0:35:13.03,Default,,0,0,0,,能干扰神经系统\N{\reng}that disrupts the nervous system.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:13.03,0:35:14.58,Default,,0,0,0,,我们知道被盗走什么吗\N{\reng}Do we know what was stolen?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:14.58,0:35:18.79,Default,,0,0,0,,他带着大量的奥利哈钢库存潜逃了\N{\reng}He escaped with a large stockpile of orichalcum.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:20.62,0:35:22.37,Default,,0,0,0,,我该知道那是什么吗\N{\reng}Am I supposed to know what that is?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:22.37,0:35:25.63,Default,,0,0,0,,奥利哈钢是远古时代使用的能量源\N{\reng}Orichalcum is a power source that was used in ancient times.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:25.63,0:35:28.30,Default,,0,0,0,,会排放大量的温室气体\N{\reng}It emits tremendous amounts of greenhouse gases
Dialogue: 0,0:35:28.30,0:35:30.13,Default,,0,0,0,,对地球造成重大伤害\N{\reng}that are highly destructive to our planet.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:30.13,0:35:33.01,Default,,0,0,0,,事实上 在我们察觉这点前\N{\reng}In fact, we almost destroyed the oceans ourselves
Dialogue: 0,0:35:33.01,0:35:34.85,Default,,0,0,0,,我们自己也差点毁了海洋\N{\reng}before we realized what we were doing.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:35.81,0:35:39.35,Default,,0,0,0,,这物质无法被安全处置 所以我们将剩余的库存\N{\reng}It can't be disposed of safely, so the remaining stockpile
Dialogue: 0,0:35:39.35,0:35:43.02,Default,,0,0,0,,分别埋在地底深处的12个贮存场中\N{\reng}has been buried in 12 storage vaults deep underground.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:43.02,0:35:44.86,Default,,0,0,0,,我们该警告其他的贮存场\N{\reng}We should warn the other places that are storing the stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:44.86,0:35:47.61,Default,,0,0,0,,他早就打劫过了 库存全没了\N{\reng}He's already been there. It's all gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:47.61,0:35:51.45,Default,,0,0,0,,我们认为他过去五个月 一直在暗中袭击\N{\reng}We think he's been launching secret raids for at least five months.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:51.45,0:35:53.03,Default,,0,0,0,,只是这次不小心被抓到\N{\reng}This is just the time he got caught.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:53.03,0:35:56.70,Default,,0,0,0,,这波全球气温飙高 在陆地酿灾\N{\reng}Well, this spike in global temperatures that's causing disasters on the surface
Dialogue: 0,0:35:56.70,0:36:00.96,Default,,0,0,0,,并让陆地居民生病的灾情 也是五个月前开始的\N{\reng}and making the sea dwellers sick happened five months ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:01.62,0:36:04.75,Default,,0,0,0,,他用偷来的奥利哈钢来加速地球暖化\N{\reng}He's using the stolen orichalcum to heat the planet.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:06.96,0:36:08.55,Default,,0,0,0,,他为何要如此\N{\reng}Why would he do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:08.55,0:36:10.38,Default,,0,0,0,,我不知道 但我会查个清楚\N{\reng}I don't know, but I'm gonna find out.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:10.38,0:36:12.93,Default,,0,0,0,,若他在用奥利哈钢加温地球\N{\reng}If he is using the orichalcum to heat the planet,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:12.93,0:36:14.09,Default,,0,0,0,,我们的时间就不多了\N{\reng}we don't have much time.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:14.09,0:36:16.22,Default,,0,0,0,,他已将此效应推越临界点\N{\reng}He is pushing this past the tipping point.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:16.22,0:36:20.81,Default,,0,0,0,,我们必须阻止他 不然全球气候崩盘迫在眉睫\N{\reng}He must be stopped or a global climate meltdown is imminent.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:20.81,0:36:23.69,Default,,0,0,0,,我们需要找到他 但他目前消失无踪\N{\reng}We need to find him, but he's completely vanished off the radar.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:23.69,0:36:26.44,Default,,0,0,0,,我想我知道有谁能帮助我们\N{\reng}I think I know someone who might be able to help us.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:27.44,0:36:28.86,Default,,0,0,0,,但你们肯定不会喜欢\N{\reng}But you're not gonna like it.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:30.48,0:36:31.61,Default,,0,0,0,,你小弟\N{\reng}Your brother?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:31.61,0:36:34.57,Default,,0,0,0,,相信我 他是我最不愿意求援的对象\N{\reng}Believe me, he's the last person I wanna go begging for help,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:34.57,0:36:36.49,Default,,0,0,0,,但他以前跟黑蝠鲼交易过\N{\reng}but he's dealt with Manta in the past,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:36.49,0:36:38.83,Default,,0,0,0,,所以唯有他可能知道如何快速找到他\N{\reng}and he's the only one who might know how to find him in time.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:38.83,0:36:42.00,Default,,0,0,0,,人鱼王国不会让你见欧姆的\N{\reng}The Fishermen will never allow you to speak to Orm.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:42.66,0:36:44.04,Default,,0,0,0,,他杀死他们的国王\N{\reng}He killed their king.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:44.83,0:36:47.21,Default,,0,0,0,,我也没想去请求他们许可\N{\reng}I wasn't exactly gonna ask for permission.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:47.21,0:36:51.67,Default,,0,0,0,,亚瑟 亚特兰提斯 无法要求同盟国交出欧姆\N{\reng}Arthur, Atlantis cannot extract Orm from an allied nation.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:51.67,0:36:53.97,Default,,0,0,0,,那等同于宣战\N{\reng}It would be an act of war.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:55.34,0:36:57.01,Default,,0,0,0,,不用亚特兰提斯出面\N{\reng}Atlantis isn't gonna do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:58.18,0:36:59.85,Default,,0,0,0,,我会自己去把他劫出来\N{\reng}I'm gonna break him out myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:00.35,0:37:03.81,Default,,0,0,0,,亚瑟 凯鲨正想找借口剥夺你的战争权\N{\reng}Arthur, Karshon is looking for a reason to seize war powers.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:03.81,0:37:06.52,Default,,0,0,0,,若她真那么做 你的王位就只剩头衔\N{\reng}You will be nothing more than a figurehead if she does that.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:06.52,0:37:09.32,Default,,0,0,0,,我的主场本来就在外界 在那里我能做出真实贡献\N{\reng}My place is out there where I belong, where I'm actually good at what I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:09.32,0:37:11.61,Default,,0,0,0,,我厌倦了束手束脚的日子\N{\reng}I'm tired of nothing ever getting done.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:12.53,0:37:13.86,Default,,0,0,0,,我非得这么做不可\N{\reng}I've got to do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:15.53,0:37:17.95,Default,,0,0,0,,若被人发现 若你被抓到…\N{\reng}If anyone finds out, if you're caught...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:19.16,0:37:21.20,Default,,0,0,0,,那会分裂所有王国\N{\reng}it will tear the kingdoms apart.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:22.91,0:37:25.79,Default,,0,0,0,,那就帮我别被抓到\N{\reng}Then help me not get caught.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:29.96,0:37:33.38,Default,,0,0,0,,泽贝尔情报处最近查出你小弟\N{\reng}Xebelian intelligence has recently learned
Dialogue: 0,0:37:33.38,0:37:36.59,Default,,0,0,0,,被关押在陆地上的一处地下秘密基地\N{\reng}that your brother is being held on the surface in a secret one-of-a-kind underground facility.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:36.59,0:37:41.44,Default,,0,0,0,,他们以为海洋居民没有勇气横渡沙漠\N{\reng}They're assuming no sea dweller would ever dare cross the desert.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:41.51,0:37:43.06,Default,,0,0,0,,我替你准备了特殊服装\N{\reng}And here's a special outfit for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:45.06,0:37:46.48,Default,,0,0,0,,这算什么 童装中号\N{\reng}What is that, boy's extra medium?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:46.48,0:37:47.85,Default,,0,0,0,,这原本就是紧身衣\N{\reng}It's supposed to be tight.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:47.85,0:37:50.73,Default,,0,0,0,,色素细胞能改变颜色 维持隐身长达一分钟\N{\reng}The chromatophores change color and camouflage you for up to a minute,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:50.73,0:37:53.32,Default,,0,0,0,,让你能躲过大多数监测器\N{\reng}making you undetectable to most sensors.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:53.73,0:37:55.61,Default,,0,0,0,,攻他们一个措手不及\N{\reng}They'll never see you coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:58.16,0:37:59.24,Default,,0,0,0,,通讯部分要怎么处理\N{\reng}What are we doing for comms?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:59.24,0:38:00.99,Default,,0,0,0,,开放式通讯风险太大\N{\reng}Open comms are too risky.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:00.99,0:38:04.54,Default,,0,0,0,,我会派一只头足类来充当你的传令兵\N{\reng}I'll be sending a cephalopod with you to act as a messenger.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:06.25,0:38:07.54,Default,,0,0,0,,那是一只章鱼\N{\reng}That's an octopus.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:07.96,0:38:10.96,Default,,0,0,0,,战术运筹与追击侦察专员\N{\reng}Tactical Operations and Pursuit Operative.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:10.96,0:38:12.88,Default,,0,0,0,,简称土拨\N{\reng}Topo, for short.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:12.88,0:38:17.05,Default,,0,0,0,,基因工程智力进化 用于渗透和间谍活动\N{\reng}Genetically engineered intelligence for infiltration and espionage.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:17.59,0:38:20.43,Default,,0,0,0,,它还会弹奏多种乐器\N{\reng}He also plays a variety of musical instruments.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:26.52,0:38:28.52,Default,,0,0,0,,等我们到了后记得保持低调 好吗\N{\reng}Just try and lay low when we get in there, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:28.52,0:38:30.35,Default,,0,0,0,,你或许是隐形的 但你的交接腕\N{\reng}You might be invisible, but your hectocotylus
Dialogue: 0,0:38:30.35,0:38:32.02,Default,,0,0,0,,开始闻起来像死鱼海底捞\N{\reng}is starting to smell like warm chum butter.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:34.82,0:38:36.40,Default,,0,0,0,,土拨 你这只笨鱿鱼\N{\reng}Aw, Topo, you dumb squid!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:36.40,0:38:37.95,Default,,0,0,0,,老天 拜托你\N{\reng}God, come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:39.91,0:38:41.24,Default,,0,0,0,,墨汁算是排泄物吗\N{\reng}Is ink piss?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:41.24,0:38:44.45,Default,,0,0,0,,这座监狱由恐怖的沙漠王国残兵看守\N{\reng}The prison is guarded by fearsome Deserter remnants.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:44.45,0:38:48.33,Default,,0,0,0,,它们是撒哈拉沙漠化后 幸存下来的厌世苦行僧\N{\reng}Death-worshipping ascetics who survived when the Sahara went dry
Dialogue: 0,0:38:48.33,0:38:51.13,Default,,0,0,0,,以血液为生\N{\reng}by turning to blood for sustenance.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:51.13,0:38:53.88,Default,,0,0,0,,若它们捕获你 就会吸干你的血液\N{\reng}If they catch you, they'll bleed you dry.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:54.67,0:38:56.30,Default,,0,0,0,,你找到欧姆时 他会很虚弱\N{\reng}When you find Orm, he'll be weak.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:57.09,0:38:59.05,Default,,0,0,0,,它们会限制他的供水量\N{\reng}They're limiting his water supply...
Dialogue: 0,0:39:00.01,0:39:02.22,Default,,0,0,0,,维持他勉强存活\N{\reng}just enough to keep him alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:05.56,0:39:09.48,Default,,0,0,0,,等你见到欧姆时 告诉他我爱他\N{\reng}And if you do see Orm, you tell him that I love him.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:10.90,0:39:14.11,Default,,0,0,0,,告诉他我每天都想着他\N{\reng}You tell him that I think of him every day.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:14.61,0:39:15.57,Default,,0,0,0,,我会的\N{\reng}I will.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:15.57,0:39:17.44,Default,,0,0,0,,听着 我知道他是你们血亲\N{\reng}Look, I know he's family,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:17.44,0:39:19.99,Default,,0,0,0,,但别忘了他是什么人\N{\reng}but you can't forget who you're dealing with here.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:19.99,0:39:21.74,Default,,0,0,0,,一旦你把欧姆劫出来\N{\reng}Once you've broken Orm out,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:21.74,0:39:23.32,Default,,0,0,0,,就得时刻防备他从背后捅刀\N{\reng}you're not gonna be able to turn your back on him.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:23.74,0:39:26.33,Default,,0,0,0,,你需要他 但不能信任他\N{\reng}You need him, but you can never trust him.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:28.76,0:40:30.02,Default,,0,0,0,,你看起来真糟糕\N{\reng}Whoo... You look rough.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:30.85,0:40:32.94,Default,,0,0,0,,见鬼了 你来这干嘛\N{\reng}What the hell are you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:33.85,0:40:34.98,Default,,0,0,0,,我是来把你劫走的\N{\reng}I'm here to break you out.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:35.94,0:40:37.27,Default,,0,0,0,,你疯了吗\N{\reng}Have you lost your mind?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:38.19,0:40:39.69,Default,,0,0,0,,是你害我被关进来的\N{\reng}You're the one who put me here.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:39.69,0:40:42.19,Default,,0,0,0,,干嘛一直翻旧帐 走吧 我们晚点再叙旧\N{\reng}Eh, why you bringing up old shit? We'll talk about it later.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:43.11,0:40:45.16,Default,,0,0,0,,你不能把我劫出去\N{\reng}You cannot break me out.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:45.16,0:40:47.78,Default,,0,0,0,,亚特兰提斯与人鱼王国间有协定\N{\reng}There's a treaty with the Fishermen Kingdom.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:47.78,0:40:50.20,Default,,0,0,0,,听着 我得阻止大卫·凯恩毁灭世界\N{\reng}Look, I gotta stop David Kane from destroying the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:50.20,0:40:52.96,Default,,0,0,0,,只有你帮得了我 你自己评估一下\N{\reng}And you're the only one that can help me. So you do the math.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:54.87,0:40:58.63,Default,,0,0,0,,-该死 -来吧荒岛男 带上你的威尔森 该闪了\N{\reng}-Oh, shit. -Come on, Cast Away. Grab Wilson. Let's roll.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:58.63,0:41:00.34,Default,,0,0,0,,快点 我们走\N{\reng}Come on. Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:14.60,0:41:15.85,Default,,0,0,0,,这不代表我们扯平了\N{\reng}This changes nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:16.94,0:41:19.48,Default,,0,0,0,,正合我意 小弟\N{\reng}Wouldn't have it any other way, little brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:20.23,0:41:21.94,Default,,0,0,0,,别叫我小弟\N{\reng}Do not call me "brother."
Dialogue: 0,0:41:24.45,0:41:26.03,Default,,0,0,0,,别这样\N{\reng}Hermanito? Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:31.04,0:41:34.29,Default,,0,0,0,,快点 土拨 你这只笨鱿鱼 快醒来帮我们开门\N{\reng}Come on, Topo, you stupid squid! Wake up and open the door.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:36.21,0:41:37.17,Default,,0,0,0,,土拨\N{\reng}Topo?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:38.79,0:41:40.29,Default,,0,0,0,,那只头足类\N{\reng}The cephalopod?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:40.29,0:41:42.25,Default,,0,0,0,,相信我 那不是我的主意\N{\reng}Trust me, it wasn't my idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:43.88,0:41:45.17,Default,,0,0,0,,土拨\N{\reng}Topo!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:57.27,0:41:58.56,Default,,0,0,0,,好了 走吧\N{\reng}All right, come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:05.82,0:42:06.95,Default,,0,0,0,,等等\N{\reng}Wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:10.24,0:42:12.58,Default,,0,0,0,,你有…带水来吗\N{\reng}Did you... bring water?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:12.58,0:42:13.79,Default,,0,0,0,,有啊\N{\reng}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:13.79,0:42:15.54,Default,,0,0,0,,不对 不好意思\N{\reng}Uh, no, sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:15.54,0:42:17.21,Default,,0,0,0,,我在路上喝光了\N{\reng}I drank it all on the way here.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:18.33,0:42:20.42,Default,,0,0,0,,- 什么 - 老弟 沙漠很热耶\N{\reng}-What? -Bro, it's hot up there.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:41.90,0:42:44.07,Default,,0,0,0,,喂 放轻松\N{\reng}Whoa! Easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:44.91,0:42:48.08,Default,,0,0,0,,哇呵呵\N{\reng}Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:52.03,0:42:54.33,Default,,0,0,0,,- 知道怎么骑这玩意吗 - 你开什么玩笑\N{\reng}-You know how to ride one of these? -Are you kidding?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:54.33,0:42:57.08,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我甚至不知道这是什么 - 什么\N{\reng}-I don't even know what the hell it is. Hyaah! -What?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:01.92,0:43:02.92,Default,,0,0,0,,好耶\N{\reng}Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:14.14,0:43:15.22,Default,,0,0,0,,好耶\N{\reng}Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:17.80,0:43:18.97,Default,,0,0,0,,噢\N{\reng}Whoa.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:35.52,0:43:37.93,Default,,0,0,0,,哦…\N{\reng}Whoa, whoa, whoa, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:15.53,0:44:17.12,Default,,0,0,0,,好了 水岸就在那边\N{\reng}All right, the water's right there.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:17.12,0:44:18.74,Default,,0,0,0,,快去吧 纸片男\N{\reng}Let's go, skinny jeans.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:08.81,0:46:10.90,Default,,0,0,0,,对 就是这样\N{\reng}Yeah. All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:11.40,0:46:12.98,Default,,0,0,0,,干得好 小弟 来击掌\N{\reng}Good job, little brother. High-five.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:12.98,0:46:14.61,Default,,0,0,0,,才不要\N{\reng}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:14.61,0:46:16.70,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧 还是干得好\N{\reng}All right. Good job.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:25.12,0:46:29.75,Default,,0,0,0,,我在亚特兰提斯还有一堆 国王的公务要做 我们该走了\N{\reng}You know, I got a bunch of king shit to do back in Atlantis so we should go.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:31.46,0:46:32.67,Default,,0,0,0,,走了 土拨\N{\reng}Ahh! Come on, Topo!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:55.48,0:46:58.03,Default,,0,0,0,,这比我想像中更糟糕\N{\reng}This is worse than I could have possibly imagined.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:58.03,0:47:01.66,Default,,0,0,0,,亚特兰提斯的安全和保障 是一种神圣的托付\N{\reng}The safety and security of Atlantis is a sacred trust.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:01.66,0:47:06.16,Default,,0,0,0,,过去一百世代 没有国王曾让国土遭受入侵\N{\reng}No king has allowed the great city wall to be breached in a hundred generations.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:06.83,0:47:08.71,Default,,0,0,0,,一百世代 真的假的\N{\reng}A hundred generations? Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:08.71,0:47:10.00,Default,,0,0,0,,那是多少年\N{\reng}How many years is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:10.00,0:47:12.63,Default,,0,0,0,,我地质学不太好 算起来有一百万年吗\N{\reng}I'm bad with geology. What is that, like, a million years?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:14.55,0:47:16.09,Default,,0,0,0,,还是你认为我是百万里挑一\N{\reng}Oh? You're calling me one in a million?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:16.09,0:47:18.47,Default,,0,0,0,,这种时候你还有心情开玩笑\N{\reng}How can you make jokes at a time like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:19.22,0:47:21.26,Default,,0,0,0,,国王乱开玩笑很有失尊严\N{\reng}It's undignified for a king to jest.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:21.26,0:47:23.60,Default,,0,0,0,,不好意思 尊贵的殿下 我只是爱用开玩笑\N{\reng}Oh, excuse me, Your Highness, if I use comedy
Dialogue: 0,0:47:23.60,0:47:26.10,Default,,0,0,0,,来掩饰自己的感情和纾解压力\N{\reng}to mask my feelings and deal with stress.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:26.10,0:47:29.56,Default,,0,0,0,,- 不这么做我就会变得像你一样 - 又紧绷又机车\N{\reng}- Otherwise, I'd end up looking like you. - A very tight butthole.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:30.39,0:47:31.77,Default,,0,0,0,,无敌龟毛\N{\reng}Super tight.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:33.56,0:47:36.57,Default,,0,0,0,,你知道 若担任领导的压力太大\N{\reng}You know, if the pressures of leadership are too stressful,
Dialogue: 0,0:47:37.07,0:47:41.28,Default,,0,0,0,,或许你应该退位 让更胜任的人成为国王\N{\reng}perhaps you should leave and let someone who knows what they're doing be king.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:43.24,0:47:44.24,Default,,0,0,0,,知道吗\N{\reng}You know what?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:44.24,0:47:47.24,Default,,0,0,0,,等一切结束后 我等不及要送你回监狱了\N{\reng}I cannot wait to throw your ass back in prison when this is all over.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:48.54,0:47:50.66,Default,,0,0,0,,不用你送 等我们阻止了大卫·凯恩\N{\reng}You won't have to.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:50.66,0:47:52.12,Default,,0,0,0,,我会自行向人鱼王国投案\N{\reng}Once I stop David Kane, I'll surrender myself to the Fishermen.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:52.12,0:47:54.34,Default,,0,0,0,,那是我对亚特兰提斯效忠的方式\N{\reng}That is my honor to Atlantis.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:55.54,0:47:56.96,Default,,0,0,0,,你真的很戏剧化\N{\reng}You're so dramatic.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:56.96,0:47:59.30,Default,,0,0,0,,随便你 只要帮我找到那混蛋就行\N{\reng}Whatever. Just help me find this asshole.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:59.30,0:48:01.80,Default,,0,0,0,,我的联系人会知道该从哪找起\N{\reng}Well, my contact will at least know where to look.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:03.97,0:48:05.89,Default,,0,0,0,,他到底发生什么事了\N{\reng}What happened to him?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:07.89,0:48:11.44,Default,,0,0,0,,我认识的大卫·凯恩只是行事不羁 却不是个疯子\N{\reng}David Kane that I knew was ruthless, but he wasn't insane.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:11.44,0:48:15.15,Default,,0,0,0,,现在这家伙却拿着枪 架上世界的脑袋并开枪\N{\reng}This guy just put a gun to the world's head and pulled the trigger.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:15.15,0:48:17.19,Default,,0,0,0,,甚至连条件都不先谈\N{\reng}Without even making any demands.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:21.34,0:49:22.59,Default,,0,0,0,,恭喜你 沈博士\N{\reng}Congratulations, Dr. Shin.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:22.59,0:49:25.09,Default,,0,0,0,,你那音波炮的功效跟你说的一样强大\N{\reng}That cannon of yours worked exactly how you said it would.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:26.59,0:49:29.64,Default,,0,0,0,,东西是你找到的 我只是研究出该怎么用\N{\reng}Well, you found it. All I did was figure out how it worked.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:31.31,0:49:34.14,Default,,0,0,0,,我本来没想到会真的拿来轰人\N{\reng}I didn't think we'd ever actually have to use it on anyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:34.69,0:49:36.60,Default,,0,0,0,,这个嘛 怎么说呢\N{\reng}Yeah, well, what can I say?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:37.19,0:49:39.02,Default,,0,0,0,,计划总是赶不上变化\N{\reng}Things don't always go as planned.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:39.02,0:49:40.73,Default,,0,0,0,,但那正是我所担心的\N{\reng}But that's what I'm afraid of.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:42.23,0:49:46.91,Default,,0,0,0,,大卫 这物质会重塑整个地球\N{\reng}David, this stuff could reshape the entire planet.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:49.87,0:49:51.62,Default,,0,0,0,,喂 博士\N{\reng}Hey, doc.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:53.79,0:49:59.63,Default,,0,0,0,,我们即将解锁人类史上最强大的力量\N{\reng}We are this close to unlocking the greatest power in human history.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:01.05,0:50:04.09,Default,,0,0,0,,别告诉我你真的想退出\N{\reng}Are you really telling me you want to walk away now?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:08.14,0:50:10.01,Default,,0,0,0,,若我说是 你会放我走吗\N{\reng}If I said yes, would you let me?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:12.31,0:50:13.39,Default,,0,0,0,,当然\N{\reng}Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:15.39,0:50:18.23,Default,,0,0,0,,想知道你在丛林里能撑多久吗\N{\reng}You want to see how long you last in that jungle?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:19.61,0:50:20.90,Default,,0,0,0,,欢迎去试\N{\reng}Be my guest.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:34.33,0:50:35.83,Default,,0,0,0,,算了 我还是留下来吧\N{\reng}Yeah, I'll stick around.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:38.62,0:50:39.88,Default,,0,0,0,,没错\N{\reng}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:54.47,0:50:56.56,Default,,0,0,0,,欢迎来到最后边疆\N{\reng}Welcome to the last frontier.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:57.43,0:51:01.52,Default,,0,0,0,,他们从世界各地搜刮废弃船只 来建造此处\N{\reng}They scavenged ships from around the world to build this place.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:02.23,0:51:03.86,Default,,0,0,0,,人称沉没堡垒\N{\reng}The Sunken Citadel.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:03.86,0:51:07.86,Default,,0,0,0,,陆地与海洋界的败类 聚集在此处互相切磋\N{\reng}It is the one place in the world where the scum of the land and sea mingle.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:09.49,0:51:11.41,Default,,0,0,0,,人们更为了隐姓埋名而来到这里\N{\reng}It is where people come to disappear.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:11.41,0:51:12.45,Default,,0,0,0,,妈啊\N{\reng}Wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:13.70,0:51:15.45,Default,,0,0,0,,这个破山寨听起来真厉害\N{\reng}It's an impressive shithole.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:16.66,0:51:18.75,Default,,0,0,0,,为何我从未听说过这地方\N{\reng}How have I never heard of this place before?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:18.75,0:51:22.50,Default,,0,0,0,,大家对此处避而不谈 这里是海盗的大本营\N{\reng}It is not meant to be common knowledge. It's a pirate haven.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:23.59,0:51:24.50,Default,,0,0,0,,海盗\N{\reng}Pirates?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:26.46,0:51:27.84,Default,,0,0,0,,我不确定你是否知道这点\N{\reng}Listen, I don't know if you know this about me,
Dialogue: 0,0:51:27.84,0:51:30.18,Default,,0,0,0,,但海盗通常不太喜欢我\N{\reng}but I'm not too popular with pirates.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:39.73,0:51:41.19,Default,,0,0,0,,我非常清楚这点\N{\reng}Oh, I'm well aware.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:47.49,0:51:50.65,Default,,0,0,0,,放轻松 只有这样才能把我俩一起弄进去\N{\reng}Relax. It was the only way to get us both in.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:54.24,0:51:55.74,Default,,0,0,0,,你至少可以先警告我\N{\reng}You could've at least given me a heads up.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:55.74,0:51:56.99,Default,,0,0,0,,那样你会配合吗\N{\reng}Would you have gone along with it?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:57.41,0:51:59.29,Default,,0,0,0,,- 才不会 - 那就闭嘴吧\N{\reng}-Hell, no. -Then put a hook in it.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:31.95,0:52:33.70,Default,,0,0,0,,在那里 那位就是王鱼\N{\reng}There. That's Kingfish.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:33.70,0:52:35.87,Default,,0,0,0,,当初就是它安排我和大卫·凯恩接头的\N{\reng}He is the one who put me in contact with David Kane.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:35.87,0:52:39.66,Default,,0,0,0,,它专门替海盗、佣兵 和奴隶贩子担任白手套仲介\N{\reng}He brokers deals with pirates, mercenaries, slavers, you name it.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:39.66,0:52:40.54,Default,,0,0,0,,好酷\N{\reng}Cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:41.41,0:52:42.54,Default,,0,0,0,,我要去挑个事\N{\reng}I'm gonna go pick a fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:42.54,0:52:45.17,Default,,0,0,0,,交给我处理吧\N{\reng}Just let me handle this.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:45.17,0:52:46.96,Default,,0,0,0,,它是我们找到黑蝠鲼的最好机会\N{\reng}He's our best shot at finding Manta,
Dialogue: 0,0:52:46.96,0:52:49.34,Default,,0,0,0,,你若跑去它面前大秀肌肉\N{\reng}and he's not going to tell us anything if you go in there
Dialogue: 0,0:52:49.34,0:52:51.13,Default,,0,0,0,,它是什么都不会说的\N{\reng}flexing your muscles at him.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:53.55,0:52:56.18,Default,,0,0,0,,你很幸运我俩没有一起长大 小弟\N{\reng}You're so lucky we didn't grow up together, little brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:57.60,0:52:59.72,Default,,0,0,0,,别叫我小弟\N{\reng}Do not call me "brother."
Dialogue: 0,0:53:00.35,0:53:01.68,Default,,0,0,0,,唉唷唷\N{\reng}Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:53:02.06,0:53:06.02,Default,,0,0,0,,真是个大惊喜\N{\reng}This is a bit of a surprise, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:06.44,0:53:09.44,Default,,0,0,0,,我没想到你已经被监狱释放了\N{\reng}I didn't realize you'd been released from prison.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:09.44,0:53:12.36,Default,,0,0,0,,我是最近才出狱的\N{\reng}It is a recent development.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:12.74,0:53:16.49,Default,,0,0,0,,反正我们都是亡命之徒 对吧\N{\reng}Outlaws, aren't we all?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:17.32,0:53:19.37,Default,,0,0,0,,我们需要找到大卫·凯恩\N{\reng}We need to find David Kane.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:20.04,0:53:22.66,Default,,0,0,0,,关于那点 恐怕我有坏消息\N{\reng}Bad news, I'm afraid.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:22.66,0:53:26.29,Default,,0,0,0,,大卫·凯恩现在不接生意了\N{\reng}David Kane is no longer on the market.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:26.29,0:53:28.84,Default,,0,0,0,,多少钱都不接\N{\reng}Not for sale at any price.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:29.38,0:53:33.92,Default,,0,0,0,,他现在自己当老板 单打独斗\N{\reng}He's solely running as an independent operator.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:34.34,0:53:36.01,Default,,0,0,0,,他的藏身处在哪\N{\reng}Where is he holed up now?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:39.56,0:53:41.97,Default,,0,0,0,,作为交换 我可以让\N{\reng}In exchange, I offer a favor...
Dialogue: 0,0:53:43.06,0:53:46.60,Default,,0,0,0,,亚特兰提斯之王欠你一次情\N{\reng}from the King of Atlantis.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:48.40,0:53:50.61,Default,,0,0,0,,你难不成真想让我跟那种\N{\reng}You seriously expect me to play footsie with someone
Dialogue: 0,0:53:50.61,0:53:52.53,Default,,0,0,0,,满手血腥的家伙打交道\N{\reng}with that kind of blood on their hands?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:52.53,0:53:55.03,Default,,0,0,0,,可我没有手\N{\reng}I don't have hands!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:55.03,0:53:56.82,Default,,0,0,0,,也没有脚\N{\reng}Or feet!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:02.66,0:54:06.33,Default,,0,0,0,,听着 若是你提供的情报核实无误\N{\reng}Um... Listen, if the information checks out good,
Dialogue: 0,0:54:06.33,0:54:11.00,Default,,0,0,0,,我保证我不会立刻回来拆了这地方\N{\reng}I promise you that I won't immediately come back here and tear this place apart.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:12.92,0:54:14.92,Default,,0,0,0,,那真是太可惜了\N{\reng}That's too bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:15.84,0:54:21.89,Default,,0,0,0,,道上规矩是亚特兰提斯之王 向来对沉没堡垒睁一只眼闭一只眼\N{\reng}Traditionally, the kings of Atlantis have turned a blind eye to the Sunken Citadel.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:22.64,0:54:26.69,Default,,0,0,0,,现在看来我们得手动替你闭眼了\N{\reng}Now, we have to blind it for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:34.82,0:54:37.03,Default,,0,0,0,,算了 你来大秀肌肉吧\N{\reng}Fine. Flex your muscles.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:49.17,0:54:50.96,Default,,0,0,0,,快打爆他的鸟头\N{\reng}Smash his stupid head in!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:52.21,0:54:53.25,Default,,0,0,0,,吃我一拳\N{\reng}Boom!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:09.02,0:55:10.27,Default,,0,0,0,,抓到你了 死胖子\N{\reng}Gotcha, fatback!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:13.65,0:55:16.74,Default,,0,0,0,,好啦好啦 万事好商量 我们聊聊\N{\reng}Okay! Okay! We can work this out. We can.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:16.74,0:55:17.95,Default,,0,0,0,,那你说啊\N{\reng}Talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:17.95,0:55:20.99,Default,,0,0,0,,我不知道他在哪 但最近有不少谣传\N{\reng}I don't know where he is, but there have been rumors.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:20.99,0:55:25.20,Default,,0,0,0,,南太平洋一个叫魔鬼深渊的休眠火山\N{\reng}A dormant volcano in the South Pacific, called "Devil's Deep."
Dialogue: 0,0:55:25.91,0:55:27.16,Default,,0,0,0,,再说快点\N{\reng}Talk faster.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:27.16,0:55:28.75,Default,,0,0,0,,那里曾经荒芜多年\N{\reng}It's been barren for years.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:28.75,0:55:30.96,Default,,0,0,0,,但旅人说最近当地出现丛林\N{\reng}But travelers say there's a jungle there now.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:30.96,0:55:33.71,Default,,0,0,0,,船只一旦靠近当地导航系统就会错乱\N{\reng}Navigation gets scrambled as soon as you start to get close.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:33.71,0:55:36.71,Default,,0,0,0,,若是太靠近 就会有去无回\N{\reng}And if you get too close, you don't come back!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:36.71,0:55:39.76,Default,,0,0,0,,若要我猜 而我真的是乱猜的\N{\reng}If I was a betting man, and believe me, I am,
Dialogue: 0,0:55:39.76,0:55:42.39,Default,,0,0,0,,我会说大卫·凯恩藏在那里\N{\reng}I'd say that's where Kane is hiding out.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:45.72,0:55:47.22,Default,,0,0,0,,消息打听到了 我们走\N{\reng}We got all we needed. Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:58.94,0:56:02.62,Default,,0,0,0,,崛起 来吧 从火中崛起\N{\reng}? Rise up, come Rise up through the fire ?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:08.41,0:56:10.71,Default,,0,0,0,,很快你就会比他更为强大\N{\reng}Soon you'll be more powerful than he is.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:11.33,0:56:16.25,Default,,0,0,0,,但你还没准备好 而且你太快让他入局了\N{\reng}But you're not ready yet, and you involved him far too soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:16.25,0:56:19.05,Default,,0,0,0,,我能感觉到他们的追兵\N{\reng}I sense them closing in on us.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:19.05,0:56:20.47,Default,,0,0,0,,我看起来很担心吗\N{\reng}Do I seem concerned?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:22.64,0:56:25.05,Default,,0,0,0,,其实这样反而更方便\N{\reng}Hmm? If anything, it's even easier now.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:25.68,0:56:27.89,Default,,0,0,0,,比我们原本自己计划得更…\N{\reng}We couldn't have planned it any better than--
Dialogue: 0,0:56:33.63,0:56:36.24,Default,,0,0,0,,哦\N{\reng}Oh. Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:36.27,0:56:41.11,Default,,0,0,0,,嗨 我只是想告诉你奥利哈钢熔炉\N{\reng}Hey. Uh, I... I just wanted to tell you that the orichalcum furnace
Dialogue: 0,0:56:41.11,0:56:43.03,Default,,0,0,0,,现在正在以最大值输出\N{\reng}is now running at peak output.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:35.71,0:57:36.71,Default,,0,0,0,,我赢了\N{\reng}I win.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:41.21,0:57:44.51,Default,,0,0,0,,土拨 回亚特兰提斯通报我们的方位\N{\reng}Topo, go back to Atlantis and give them our coordinates.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:52.64,0:57:54.19,Default,,0,0,0,,你知道现在有什么会很棒吗\N{\reng}You know what'd be amazing right now?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:54.19,0:57:55.19,Default,,0,0,0,,援兵\N{\reng}Reinforcements?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:55.19,0:57:58.15,Default,,0,0,0,,超大又多汁的起司汉堡 再加上一大杯黑啤酒\N{\reng}Great, big, greasy cheeseburger and a pint of Guinness.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:59.61,0:58:01.98,Default,,0,0,0,,你得承认 陆地的食物真的好吃很多\N{\reng}You gotta admit, the food is so much better up here.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:01.98,0:58:03.44,Default,,0,0,0,,这种说法有点离谱\N{\reng}I find that hard to believe.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:03.44,0:58:04.90,Default,,0,0,0,,等等\N{\reng}Hold up.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:04.90,0:58:06.99,Default,,0,0,0,,你是说你从没为了起司汉堡上岸过\N{\reng}You telling me you never went topside to have a cheeseburger?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:06.99,0:58:09.58,Default,,0,0,0,,- 什么 - 或是为了腊肠披萨\N{\reng}-What? -Or a slice of 'za? Pepperoni?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:10.49,0:58:14.41,Default,,0,0,0,,或是为了超厚半生牛排 配上薯条和奶昔 再沾上…\N{\reng}Or a thick, juicy, medium raw steak
Dialogue: 0,0:58:14.41,0:58:18.75,Default,,0,0,0,,就连陆地居民食物的名称 听起来都很噁烂\N{\reng}with fries and a shake, and you dip it--Even the words that surface-dwellers give their food sound disgusting.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:20.75,0:58:23.38,Default,,0,0,0,,因为偏见 你失去享受半个世界的乐趣\N{\reng}You've let your prejudices stop you from enjoying half the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:23.96,0:58:27.18,Default,,0,0,0,,你该好好反思 那是你的损失 兄弟\N{\reng}You should think about that. It's your loss, dude.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:35.81,0:58:37.23,Default,,0,0,0,,好耶\N{\reng}Aw, yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:37.23,0:58:38.65,Default,,0,0,0,,我打赌你从没吃过这个\N{\reng}Bet you never had one of these.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:39.52,0:58:41.36,Default,,0,0,0,,- 那是什么 - 蟑螂\N{\reng}-What is it? -It's a cockroach.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:42.53,0:58:43.32,Default,,0,0,0,,你们会吃这个\N{\reng}You eat it?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:43.32,0:58:45.24,Default,,0,0,0,,对啊 这等同陆地的鲜虾\N{\reng}Oh, yeah. Shrimp of the land.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:02.25,0:59:04.76,Default,,0,0,0,,-嗯嗯  -对吧 很好吃 来 这个给你喝\N{\reng}-Mmm. Mmm. -Eh? That's good. Here, drink this.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:09.01,0:59:10.18,Default,,0,0,0,,好 你先请\N{\reng}Okay, you first.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:43.67,0:59:45.05,Default,,0,0,0,,你有看到这个吗\N{\reng}Are you seeing this?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:48.13,0:59:49.22,Default,,0,0,0,,这不正常吗\N{\reng}That's not normal?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:54.14,0:59:55.56,Default,,0,0,0,,肯定不正常\N{\reng}Definitely not normal. Ugh.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:59.35,1:00:02.73,Default,,0,0,0,,我们走吧 现在你知道奥利哈钢有多危险了\N{\reng}Let's get out of here. You see how dangerous the orichalcum can be?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:02.73,1:00:05.86,Default,,0,0,0,,我打赌那在短时间内 让岛上动植物都变异了\N{\reng}I bet it mutated the flora and fauna in a short amount of time,
Dialogue: 0,1:00:05.86,1:00:08.57,Default,,0,0,0,,变得超…巨大\N{\reng}turning them... monstrous.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:08.65,1:00:09.52,Default,,0,0,0,,喔\N{\reng}Whoa.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:18.95,1:00:19.87,Default,,0,0,0,,糟糕\N{\reng}Oh, shit...
Dialogue: 0,1:00:31.76,1:00:32.59,Default,,0,0,0,,快逃啊\N{\reng}Run!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:35.89,1:00:36.81,Default,,0,0,0,,快点\N{\reng}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:39.43,1:00:40.48,Default,,0,0,0,,再跑快点\N{\reng}Faster!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:47.36,1:00:48.57,Default,,0,0,0,,你在耍什么宝\N{\reng}What the hell are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:49.15,1:00:50.65,Default,,0,0,0,,我不知道 我不太习惯跑步\N{\reng}I don't know. I'm not used to running.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:50.65,1:00:51.78,Default,,0,0,0,,跟着我做\N{\reng}Just do what I do.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:51.78,1:00:53.57,Default,,0,0,0,,用手臂和腿 手刀摆动起来\N{\reng}Use your arms, use your legs. Lift them up.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:54.24,1:00:55.24,Default,,0,0,0,,像这样吗\N{\reng}Like this?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:57.20,1:00:58.66,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你不是吧 - 好耶\N{\reng}-Holy shit. -Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:58.66,1:01:00.08,Default,,0,0,0,,- 等等我 - 好耶\N{\reng}-Wait up. -Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:26.16,1:01:28.46,Default,,0,0,0,,哦\N{\reng}Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:32.53,1:01:34.24,Default,,0,0,0,,我们得跳下去 这高度摔不死\N{\reng}We have to jump. We'll survive the fall.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:34.24,1:01:35.95,Default,,0,0,0,,你疯了吗 那会很痛\N{\reng}Are you crazy? It's gonna hurt.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:35.95,1:01:38.74,Default,,0,0,0,,不然你想怎样 留在这里跟跳跳鬼打一架\N{\reng}What do you wanna do, stay here and fight the hopping demons?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:39.99,1:01:41.91,Default,,0,0,0,,那是什么 上面写什么\N{\reng}What is that? What does that say?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:41.91,1:01:43.50,Default,,0,0,0,,那是古老的亚特兰提斯语\N{\reng}The writing is ancient Atlantean.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:43.50,1:01:46.58,Default,,0,0,0,,"真正的王者搭建桥梁"\N{\reng}"A true king builds bridges."
Dialogue: 0,1:01:51.26,1:01:52.30,Default,,0,0,0,,你想干嘛\N{\reng}What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:57.60,1:01:59.31,Default,,0,0,0,,你还有比这更瞎的主意吗\N{\reng}Got any more krill-brained ideas?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:27.75,1:02:30.17,Default,,0,0,0,,你看 真正的王者搭建桥梁\N{\reng}See? A true king builds bridges.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:32.88,1:02:34.01,Default,,0,0,0,,那只是一种隐喻\N{\reng}That's a metaphor!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:34.80,1:02:36.88,Default,,0,0,0,,喔对 我忘记告诉你了\N{\reng}Hey! I forgot to tell you.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:36.88,1:02:38.30,Default,,0,0,0,,老妈说她很爱你\N{\reng}Mom says she loves you.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:38.30,1:02:40.39,Default,,0,0,0,,也总是想着你\N{\reng}She thinks about you all the time.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:40.39,1:02:42.47,Default,,0,0,0,,你干嘛挑现在告诉我\N{\reng}Why the hell are you telling me this now?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:42.47,1:02:45.14,Default,,0,0,0,,我也不知道 懒得等待适当时机了\N{\reng}I don't know. I'm just tired of waiting for the right moment.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:52.02,1:02:53.03,Default,,0,0,0,,快点\N{\reng}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:21.18,1:03:23.64,Default,,0,0,0,,看来我的隐喻刚救了你一命\N{\reng}Looks like my metaphor just saved your ass.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:33.44,1:03:36.57,Default,,0,0,0,,大卫 我刚才做了更多测试 但这些数据很让人忧心\N{\reng}Uh, David? I just ran more tests, and this data is really disturbing.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:36.57,1:03:39.49,Default,,0,0,0,,我们得停止燃烧奥利哈钢\N{\reng}We have to stop burning the... orichalcum.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:42.03,1:03:43.03,Default,,0,0,0,,大卫\N{\reng}David?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:48.74,1:03:50.27,Default,,0,0,0,,噢\N{\reng}Oh.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:52.10,1:04:57.40,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧 博士 既然你这么想知道我的大计\N{\reng}Okay, doc, you want to know my plan so bad.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:58.48,1:04:59.82,Default,,0,0,0,,那就告诉你吧\N{\reng}Here it is.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:00.69,1:05:04.49,Default,,0,0,0,,我要干掉海王 毁掉他所珍视的一切\N{\reng}I'm gonna kill Aquaman and destroy everything he holds dear.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:05.62,1:05:10.96,Default,,0,0,0,,我要杀光他的家人 将他的王国焚烧殆尽\N{\reng}I'm gonna murder his family and burn his kingdom to ash.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:11.96,1:05:15.75,Default,,0,0,0,,我会为我父亲报仇\N{\reng}I will avenge my father.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:16.42,1:05:19.71,Default,,0,0,0,,就算得跟魔鬼交易也没问题\N{\reng}Even if I have to make a deal with the devil to do it.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:20.97,1:05:23.88,Default,,0,0,0,,大卫 你不能信任那支三叉戟\N{\reng}David, you can't trust the trident.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:28.89,1:05:34.35,Default,,0,0,0,,我从不轻易拔出这把匕首 除非确定能见血\N{\reng}I never draw this blade unless it's gonna taste blood.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:36.81,1:05:39.40,Default,,0,0,0,,你最好祈祷我不会再对你拔刀\N{\reng}Pray I never show it to you again.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:03.76,1:06:06.01,Default,,0,0,0,,我们肯定接近放射源了\N{\reng}We must be getting close to the radiation source.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:06.47,1:06:08.76,Default,,0,0,0,,我们该先等亚特兰提斯 接到通报再行动\N{\reng}We should wait for Atlantis to receive your message.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:08.76,1:06:10.56,Default,,0,0,0,,目前可以先行侦察\N{\reng}We can conduct reconnaissance in the meantime.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:10.56,1:06:13.56,Default,,0,0,0,,好喔 洛基 没人在问你的意见\N{\reng}Yeah. Look, Loki, I'm not asking for your advice on this.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:13.56,1:06:15.48,Default,,0,0,0,,你已经完成你的阶段任务\N{\reng}You've already lived up to your end of the deal.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:15.48,1:06:17.90,Default,,0,0,0,,欢迎你随时返回阿兹卡班\N{\reng}So you can go on back to Azkaban for all I care.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:17.90,1:06:19.44,Default,,0,0,0,,那你有何计划\N{\reng}So, what's your plan?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:19.44,1:06:20.77,Default,,0,0,0,,我没计划\N{\reng}I don't have one, yet. But he came after my wife,
Dialogue: 0,1:06:20.77,1:06:23.86,Default,,0,0,0,,但他攻击我妻子 所以我非搞死他不可\N{\reng}which means I'm gonna pull his tongue out of his butt.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:24.40,1:06:27.07,Default,,0,0,0,,亚瑟 你是国王 不可意气用事\N{\reng}Arthur, you are the king. You cannot let this get personal.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:27.49,1:06:29.74,Default,,0,0,0,,当初拿整个王国来赌气的人\N{\reng}This coming from the guy who turned the entire nation of Atlantis
Dialogue: 0,1:06:29.74,1:06:31.41,Default,,0,0,0,,也好意思这么说\N{\reng}into his own private ego trip?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:31.41,1:06:32.54,Default,,0,0,0,,我赌气\N{\reng}My ego?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:32.54,1:06:35.79,Default,,0,0,0,,是你自己先来踢馆挑战我的王位\N{\reng}You're the one who swam through the front gate and challenged my claim for the throne.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:35.79,1:06:38.08,Default,,0,0,0,,那只是因为你想毁灭陆地世界\N{\reng}Only because you're trying to destroy the surface world.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:38.08,1:06:40.46,Default,,0,0,0,,若你没有那么恶劣 现在还会是国王\N{\reng}If you weren't such an asshole, you'd still be king.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:41.34,1:06:42.13,Default,,0,0,0,,太扯了\N{\reng}Unbelievable.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:42.67,1:06:43.55,Default,,0,0,0,,等等 等等\N{\reng}Wait, wait! Wait!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:43.55,1:06:46.13,Default,,0,0,0,,你抢了我的王位却根本不想要\N{\reng}You took my throne and you don't even want it?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:46.13,1:06:48.84,Default,,0,0,0,,你是在搞笑吧 我恨死这工作了\N{\reng}Are you kidding me? I hate this job.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:48.84,1:06:51.81,Default,,0,0,0,,我这样做纯粹是为了 防止亚特兰提斯毁灭陆地世界\N{\reng}Only reason I'm doing it is to keep Atlantis from destroying the surface.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:51.81,1:06:53.52,Default,,0,0,0,,而且我很可能正越搞越糟\N{\reng}And I might even be screwing that up.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:53.52,1:06:54.81,Default,,0,0,0,,你真的无心王位\N{\reng}You really had no ambition for it?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:54.81,1:06:55.98,Default,,0,0,0,,完全无意\N{\reng}Absolutely not.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:56.52,1:06:58.65,Default,,0,0,0,,从我父亲发现你存在的那天起\N{\reng}From the day my father found out you existed,
Dialogue: 0,1:06:58.65,1:07:00.40,Default,,0,0,0,,他就训练我做好准备\N{\reng}he prepared me for the moment that you would come
Dialogue: 0,1:07:00.40,1:07:01.65,Default,,0,0,0,,以防你有朝一日来篡位\N{\reng}and challenge me for the throne.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:01.65,1:07:03.28,Default,,0,0,0,,那也太可悲了\N{\reng}Wow, that's really sad.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:03.28,1:07:04.78,Default,,0,0,0,,特别是我那么容易就打趴你\N{\reng}Especially when you think how easily I kicked your ass
Dialogue: 0,1:07:04.78,1:07:06.61,Default,,0,0,0,,根本不需准备工作\N{\reng}with basically no prep time whatsoever.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:07.95,1:07:08.95,Default,,0,0,0,,打脸了\N{\reng}Roasted.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:09.49,1:07:11.12,Default,,0,0,0,,事情经过不是那样的\N{\reng}That is not how it happened.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:11.12,1:07:12.74,Default,,0,0,0,,- 事情的经过正是如此 - 是梅拉救了你\N{\reng}-That's exactly how it happened. -Mera saved you.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:12.74,1:07:14.20,Default,,0,0,0,,她才没有 是我自己打趴你\N{\reng}No, she didn't. I kicked your ass.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:14.20,1:07:16.83,Default,,0,0,0,,才怪 她操纵了水龙卷 我被卷入其中\N{\reng}Nope. She made the little water tornado. I fell in it.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:16.83,1:07:18.29,Default,,0,0,0,,闭嘴 我们应该到了\N{\reng}Okay, shut up. I think we're here.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:27.09,1:07:28.62,Default,,0,0,0,,睡吧 阿罗哈\N{\reng}Sleep, aloha.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:28.68,1:07:29.97,Default,,0,0,0,,来吧 我们上吧\N{\reng}Come on, let's do this.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:29.97,1:07:32.56,Default,,0,0,0,,等一切完事后 我们该去吃汉堡喝啤酒\N{\reng}Once this is over with, we should go get some burgers and beers.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:32.56,1:07:34.64,Default,,0,0,0,,- 别得寸进尺 - 塔可和龙舌兰酒\N{\reng}-Don't push it. -Tacos and tequila.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:34.64,1:07:36.18,Default,,0,0,0,,根本没听过那些东西\N{\reng}I don't even know those words.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:48.11,1:07:49.17,Default,,0,0,0,,- 哦 - 嘘\N{\reng}-Huh? -Shh!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:03.46,1:08:04.50,Default,,0,0,0,,喂\N{\reng}Hey!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:38.66,1:08:39.91,Default,,0,0,0,,等等 小弟\N{\reng}Whoa, brother.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:43.33,1:08:44.60,Default,,0,0,0,,唦\N{\reng}Sasa!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:50.59,1:08:52.18,Default,,0,0,0,,那是奥利哈钢熔炉\N{\reng}It's an orichalcum furnace.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:53.47,1:08:54.97,Default,,0,0,0,,所有被偷走的奥利哈钢\N{\reng}All that stolen orichalcum.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:54.97,1:08:56.72,Default,,0,0,0,,就这样烧个不停\N{\reng}They're just burning it up.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:56.72,1:08:58.72,Default,,0,0,0,,他是故意要让大气升温\N{\reng}He's heating the atmosphere on purpose.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:59.10,1:09:00.64,Default,,0,0,0,,这真是大灾难\N{\reng}This is catastrophic.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:01.06,1:09:02.73,Default,,0,0,0,,这地方肯定有隔热罩\N{\reng}This whole place must be heat-shielded to protect it
Dialogue: 0,1:09:02.73,1:09:05.11,Default,,0,0,0,,好躲过地表热能卫星的侦测\N{\reng}from the surface's thermal satellites.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:05.69,1:09:07.15,Default,,0,0,0,,问题是 要怎么阻止\N{\reng}Question is, how do we stop 'em?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:07.15,1:09:10.32,Default,,0,0,0,,要摧毁这些反应炉 我们必须夷平整座岛屿\N{\reng}To take out this reactor, we would have to crater the entire island.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:10.32,1:09:12.40,Default,,0,0,0,,离控制台远点\N{\reng}Get away from there! Now!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:14.28,1:09:18.58,Default,,0,0,0,,这把雷射枪可能很古老 却是专为杀死亚特兰提斯人而制成\N{\reng}This blaster may be ancient, but it was built for killing Atlanteans.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:24.88,1:09:27.04,Default,,0,0,0,,好 很抱歉 我不是那个意思\N{\reng}Okay, I am so sorry. I did not mean that.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:27.04,1:09:29.63,Default,,0,0,0,,我只是怕你们会在我投降前先打死我\N{\reng}I just didn't want you to break me in half before I could surrender.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:31.30,1:09:32.51,Default,,0,0,0,,求你们带我走\N{\reng}Please take me with you.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:34.18,1:09:36.14,Default,,0,0,0,,敲昏他 然后帮我把这些人藏起来\N{\reng}Knock him out and then help me hide these bodies.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:36.76,1:09:38.14,Default,,0,0,0,,不 等等 拜托\N{\reng}No, no. Wait, please.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:38.93,1:09:40.47,Default,,0,0,0,,这完全不是我的本意\N{\reng}I didn't want any of this.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:40.47,1:09:43.69,Default,,0,0,0,,我原本只是想亲眼目睹亚特兰提斯\N{\reng}All I wanted was to see Atlantis with my own eyes.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:43.69,1:09:45.90,Default,,0,0,0,,我以为可以跟世界分享这奇迹\N{\reng}I thought I could share its wonders with the world.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:45.90,1:09:49.36,Default,,0,0,0,,我是科学家 只想被认真对待\N{\reng}I'm a scientist, and I just wanted to be taken seriously.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:50.15,1:09:53.11,Default,,0,0,0,,大卫·凯恩说他能帮我 但现在他不放我离开\N{\reng}David Kane said he could help me, but now he won't let me leave.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:53.11,1:09:56.32,Default,,0,0,0,,你指望我们相信你跟这一切无关\N{\reng}You expect us to believe you have nothing to do with this?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:57.37,1:09:58.49,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道\N{\reng}I know.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:58.99,1:10:00.58,Default,,0,0,0,,我做了些很不光彩的事\N{\reng}I've done things I'm not proud of.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:01.16,1:10:02.91,Default,,0,0,0,,但若我不照办他就会杀了我\N{\reng}But he would've killed me if I hadn't.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:04.92,1:10:05.92,Default,,0,0,0,,敲昏他\N{\reng}Knock him out.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:07.08,1:10:07.96,Default,,0,0,0,,不要\N{\reng}No.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:08.50,1:10:10.21,Default,,0,0,0,,- 那我来敲昏他 - 不行\N{\reng}-Then I'll knock him out. -No!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:11.42,1:10:12.59,Default,,0,0,0,,- 什么 - 不行\N{\reng}-What? -No.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:14.47,1:10:15.59,Default,,0,0,0,,好啦\N{\reng}Fine!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:16.59,1:10:17.85,Default,,0,0,0,,你可以跟我们一起走\N{\reng}You can come with us.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:18.85,1:10:19.68,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢你们\N{\reng}Oh... thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:19.68,1:10:22.68,Default,,0,0,0,,但你最好从实招来 否则就会被我毒打\N{\reng}But you better start talking. Or I'm gonna give you one sasa!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:22.68,1:10:24.06,Default,,0,0,0,,好啦 好啦\N{\reng}Okay, okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:24.06,1:10:27.77,Default,,0,0,0,,是那支黑色三叉戟 它连结着某种上古邪灵\N{\reng}It's the black trident. It's a direct link to some ancient evil.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:27.77,1:10:29.48,Default,,0,0,0,,它赋予凯恩强大力量 作为回馈…\N{\reng}It gives Kane great powers and in return--
Dialogue: 0,1:10:47.12,1:10:49.34,Default,,0,0,0,,我讨厌被炸飞\N{\reng}I hate when that happens.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:02.22,1:11:03.56,Default,,0,0,0,,阻止他们\N{\reng}Stop them!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:05.66,1:13:08.32,Default,,0,0,0,,哦\N{\reng}Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:08.46,1:13:09.93,Default,,0,0,0,,啊\N{\reng}Ow!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:10.07,1:13:11.70,Default,,0,0,0,,啊\N{\reng}Ow!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:16.90,1:13:19.53,Default,,0,0,0,,不不 别用奥利哈钢\N{\reng}No, no, no, no, no! Not the orichalcum!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:19.53,1:13:20.78,Default,,0,0,0,,你想炸飞我们吗\N{\reng}You wanna blow us up?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:20.78,1:13:22.57,Default,,0,0,0,,- 这东西会爆炸 - 对\N{\reng}-This stuff blows up? -Yes!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:22.57,1:13:23.61,Default,,0,0,0,,真倒霉\N{\reng}My bad!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:27.24,1:13:29.04,Default,,0,0,0,,那就别用它来打斗\N{\reng}Then stop using it!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:29.54,1:13:31.29,Default,,0,0,0,,闭嘴 乖乖等我来救你\N{\reng}Just shut up and let me save your ass.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:32.00,1:13:33.00,Default,,0,0,0,,又一次\N{\reng}Again.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:56.29,1:14:58.71,Default,,0,0,0,,他要不穿动力装甲跟我们打\N{\reng}He's going to fight us without the power suit?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:58.71,1:15:00.54,Default,,0,0,0,,我跟你说过他变强大了\N{\reng}I told you he's stronger now.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:01.75,1:15:03.51,Default,,0,0,0,,但他还是一个陆地居民\N{\reng}He's still just a surface-dweller.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:12.47,1:15:13.18,Default,,0,0,0,,-小弟  -别\N{\reng}-Bro! -Bah!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:18.77,1:15:22.82,Default,,0,0,0,,我从未想过会看到你俩并肩作战\N{\reng}I never expected to see you two fighting side by side.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:22.82,1:15:25.19,Default,,0,0,0,,我们是特地为你合体的\N{\reng}We're making a special exception just for you.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:30.53,1:15:33.08,Default,,0,0,0,,谁都不准揍我弟 除了我以外\N{\reng}No one hits my brother but me.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:33.08,1:15:37.58,Default,,0,0,0,,我原本打算最后再去杀你 但多谢你主动来访\N{\reng}I was gonna kill you last, but thanks for dropping by.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:37.58,1:15:39.29,Default,,0,0,0,,你让我省了好多麻烦\N{\reng}You're making this easy.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:52.89,1:15:53.68,Default,,0,0,0,,对\N{\reng}Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:54.27,1:15:55.14,Default,,0,0,0,,放马过来\N{\reng}Come at me,
Dialogue: 0,1:15:55.14,1:15:56.48,Default,,0,0,0,,杀手级国王组\N{\reng}The killer of kings.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:57.08,1:16:58.66,Default,,0,0,0,,夷平这座岛\N{\reng}Take that island down!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:21.85,1:17:23.19,Default,,0,0,0,,自由开火\N{\reng}Fire at will!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:35.03,1:17:36.62,Default,,0,0,0,,我们得尽快离开这里\N{\reng}We've got to get out of here.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:47.09,1:17:50.13,Default,,0,0,0,,故障、故障 警告、警告\N{\reng}Malfunction. Malfunction. Warning. Warning.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:16.20,1:18:17.74,Default,,0,0,0,,老沈 快点\N{\reng}Shin, let's go!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:23.00,1:18:24.37,Default,,0,0,0,,你还在等什么\N{\reng}What are you waiting for?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:24.37,1:18:26.33,Default,,0,0,0,,快发射音波炮\N{\reng}Fire the goddamn cannon!
Dialogue: 0,1:19:30.15,1:19:31.65,Default,,0,0,0,,抱歉害你们卷入这一切\N{\reng}I'm sorry to drag you all into this.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:31.65,1:19:34.24,Default,,0,0,0,,但我们不能让人鱼王国知道 亚特兰提斯有介入\N{\reng}But the Fishermen can't think that Atlantis was involved.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:34.24,1:19:37.57,Default,,0,0,0,,泽贝尔的军队归我管 不归亚特兰提斯管\N{\reng}Atlantis does not command the armies of Xebel. I do.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:37.57,1:19:41.08,Default,,0,0,0,,我们盐海王国仍然记得你的恩情\N{\reng}And the Brine Kingdom has not forgotten its debt to you.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:41.08,1:19:42.74,Default,,0,0,0,,有事总是可以找我们相助\N{\reng}You may count on us always.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:43.54,1:19:44.91,Default,,0,0,0,,当我手握黑色三叉戟时\N{\reng}Something happened to me.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:45.70,1:19:47.83,Default,,0,0,0,,有奇怪的事发生在我身上\N{\reng}When I touched that black trident.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:48.37,1:19:49.96,Default,,0,0,0,,他为何在这里\N{\reng}Why is he even here?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:50.67,1:19:52.34,Default,,0,0,0,,他该在返回监狱的路上\N{\reng}He should be on his way back to prison.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:52.34,1:19:54.05,Default,,0,0,0,,我们该听听他要说什么\N{\reng}We should hear what he has to say.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:54.05,1:19:55.92,Default,,0,0,0,,这种错我犯过一次\N{\reng}I made that mistake once.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:55.92,1:19:58.09,Default,,0,0,0,,所以我知道不该相信他\N{\reng}That's why I know he can't be trusted.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:58.09,1:20:00.89,Default,,0,0,0,,他还砍断我的螯足\N{\reng}And he cut off my claw.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:01.64,1:20:04.14,Default,,0,0,0,,花了一整年才长回来\N{\reng}This thing took a whole year to grow back.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:04.14,1:20:06.60,Default,,0,0,0,,听着 他跟我们一样想阻止黑蝠鲼\N{\reng}Look, he wants to stop Manta same as we do.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:06.60,1:20:08.44,Default,,0,0,0,,说句公道话\N{\reng}And just for the record,
Dialogue: 0,1:20:08.44,1:20:10.65,Default,,0,0,0,,多亏了他我们才能追查到这里\N{\reng}the only reason we made it this far is because of him.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:12.90,1:20:14.32,Default,,0,0,0,,我看到了失落王国\N{\reng}I saw the Lost Kingdom.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:18.15,1:20:20.82,Default,,0,0,0,,妈 我对这些事了解不够深\N{\reng}Mom, I don't know enough about this.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:20.82,1:20:22.41,Default,,0,0,0,,这有可能吗\N{\reng}Is that even possible?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:22.87,1:20:25.87,Default,,0,0,0,,大家只确切知道 曾有第七个王国的存在\N{\reng}All anyone knows for sure is there once was a seventh kingdom
Dialogue: 0,1:20:25.87,1:20:28.96,Default,,0,0,0,,然后在大沉没前的某天\N{\reng}and then one day, just before the fall,
Dialogue: 0,1:20:28.96,1:20:31.54,Default,,0,0,0,,该国历史被从所有史书中抹去\N{\reng}every record of it was stricken from the chronicles.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:32.17,1:20:34.75,Default,,0,0,0,,你怎么知道你看到的就是失落王国\N{\reng}How do you know what you saw was the Lost Kingdom?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:34.75,1:20:37.76,Default,,0,0,0,,大家甚至不知道它的国名\N{\reng}No one even knows what it was called anymore.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:37.76,1:20:39.38,Default,,0,0,0,,它叫涅库斯\N{\reng}It's called Necrus.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:40.43,1:20:42.01,Default,,0,0,0,,我不仅仅有看到\N{\reng}And I didn't just see it.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:43.35,1:20:44.39,Default,,0,0,0,,我还心知肚明\N{\reng}I knew it.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:46.31,1:20:49.31,Default,,0,0,0,,那感觉就像是回忆起往日\N{\reng}It's almost like I was... remembering it.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:50.81,1:20:54.19,Default,,0,0,0,,陌生的记忆突然涌入脑海\N{\reng}Flashes of someone else's memories.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:55.07,1:20:59.82,Default,,0,0,0,,在亚特兰王在位期间 亚特兰提斯由七个联合王国组成\N{\reng}During King Atlan's time, there were seven united kingdoms of Atlantis.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:01.24,1:21:05.12,Default,,0,0,0,,而黑城就像是万恶的根源\N{\reng}And the Black City was a curse upon them all.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:11.96,1:21:13.79,Default,,0,0,0,,借由滥采奥利哈钢\N{\reng}By exploiting orichalcum,
Dialogue: 0,1:21:13.79,1:21:17.05,Default,,0,0,0,,涅库斯很快就成为超级强权\N{\reng}Necrus rapidly became a superpower unlike any other.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:17.05,1:21:18.96,Default,,0,0,0,,但这带来惨痛的代价\N{\reng}But it came at a terrible price.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:19.38,1:21:21.38,Default,,0,0,0,,污染陆地与海洋\N{\reng}Poisoning the land, the sea,
Dialogue: 0,1:21:22.22,1:21:25.14,Default,,0,0,0,,就连掌管涅库斯的暴君心智都被戕害\N{\reng}even the mind of the tyrant who ruled Necrus.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:28.43,1:21:30.98,Default,,0,0,0,,也就是亚特兰的亲弟弟寇达斯\N{\reng}Atlan's own brother, Kordax.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:31.73,1:21:36.82,Default,,0,0,0,,亚特兰央求他在造成 世界不可逆的损害前停止\N{\reng}Atlan pleaded with him to stop using it before the world was irrevocably damaged.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:36.82,1:21:39.40,Default,,0,0,0,,然而寇达斯却憎恨亚特兰\N{\reng}However, Kordax resented Atlan,
Dialogue: 0,1:21:39.40,1:21:42.40,Default,,0,0,0,,认为自己大哥只想窃取他的力量\N{\reng}thinking his own brother was trying to steal his power.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:42.78,1:21:47.03,Default,,0,0,0,,所以他求助黑魔法 并打造出邪恶法器\N{\reng}So, he resorted to dark magic and crafted an instrument of evil.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:47.83,1:21:49.25,Default,,0,0,0,,就是那黑色三叉戟\N{\reng}That black trident.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:58.50,1:22:02.22,Default,,0,0,0,,他将自己和子民幻化成怪兽\N{\reng}He transformed his people and himself into monsters...
Dialogue: 0,1:22:06.30,1:22:07.72,Default,,0,0,0,,好对抗亚特兰提斯\N{\reng}...to fight Atlantis.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:08.43,1:22:10.10,Default,,0,0,0,,两兄弟因此兵戎相见\N{\reng}So, the two brothers went to war.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:19.40,1:22:24.32,Default,,0,0,0,,但亚特兰击败了寇达斯 并用自己的鲜血施下魔咒\N{\reng}But Atlan defeated Kordax and imprisoned him and all of Necrus
Dialogue: 0,1:22:24.32,1:22:27.28,Default,,0,0,0,,好将他与涅库斯人民全数囚禁\N{\reng}with a spell cast with his own blood...
Dialogue: 0,1:22:30.62,1:22:34.12,Default,,0,0,0,,以确保寇达斯的黑魔法永远消失\N{\reng}...to ensure that Kordax's dark power would never be found.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:35.83,1:22:38.50,Default,,0,0,0,,涅库斯也因此被从史书中抹去\N{\reng}And that is why Necrus is stricken from the chronicles.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:49.85,1:22:53.10,Default,,0,0,0,,邪恶力量原本该永世被冰封\N{\reng}This evil was supposed to remain frozen for eternity.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:55.48,1:22:57.48,Default,,0,0,0,,但却被大卫·凯恩寻获\N{\reng}But David Kane has found it.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:58.65,1:23:00.73,Default,,0,0,0,,那力量也逐渐掌控他\N{\reng}And it's slowly possessing him.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:01.73,1:23:05.45,Default,,0,0,0,,但即便冰帽融化 寇达斯仍无法重见天日\N{\reng}But even with the ice cap melting, Kordax still can't be freed.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:05.45,1:23:08.16,Default,,0,0,0,,亚特兰用鲜血魔咒 将寇达斯封锁在笼牢中\N{\reng}Atlan used blood magic to seal Kordax in his prison.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:08.16,1:23:10.12,Default,,0,0,0,,只有亚特兰才能释放他\N{\reng}Only Atlan himself could release him.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:10.12,1:23:14.62,Default,,0,0,0,,黑蝠鲼不需要亚特兰本人 只需要他的血\N{\reng}Manta doesn't need Atlan himself. Manta needs Atlan's blood.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:15.25,1:23:17.08,Default,,0,0,0,,血咒跟一般魔法不同 更像是DNA辨识\N{\reng}Blood magic isn't really magic, it's DNA.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:17.08,1:23:22.00,Default,,0,0,0,,想开启寇达斯的笼牢 就需要以皇室血亲鲜血为钥\N{\reng}The key to Kordax's prison is the royal bloodline itself.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:22.59,1:23:25.97,Default,,0,0,0,,意思是他需要你、我 或是亚瑟的血\N{\reng}That means he needs blood from either you, me or Arthur.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:28.39,1:23:29.55,Default,,0,0,0,,我们是王室最后血脉\N{\reng}We're the end of the bloodline.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:33.85,1:23:35.02,Default,,0,0,0,,不 我们不是\N{\reng}No, we're not.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:36.44,1:23:38.90,Default,,0,0,0,,原本世界各地就频传野火灾情\N{\reng}...Wildfires would have made headlines across the world,
Dialogue: 0,1:23:38.90,1:23:41.19,Default,,0,0,0,,现在更是几乎每周出现\N{\reng}but now, they're almost a weekly occurrence.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:41.19,1:23:44.44,Default,,0,0,0,,此刻全球正见证前所未有的气候异象\N{\reng}We're witnessing unprecedented weather events across the globe,
Dialogue: 0,1:23:44.44,1:23:47.99,Default,,0,0,0,,气象学家也不知该如何解释 全球气候的快速变迁\N{\reng}and meteorologists are at a loss to explain this rapid change in climate.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:47.99,1:23:49.82,Default,,0,0,0,,从炽热的热浪和干旱\N{\reng}From sweltering heatwaves and droughts,
Dialogue: 0,1:23:49.82,1:23:53.33,Default,,0,0,0,,不断打破高温记录 到暴雨和洪水\N{\reng}which are shattering temperature records,
Dialogue: 0,1:23:53.33,1:23:55.08,Default,,0,0,0,,- 到底怎么回事 - 飓风席卷东岸\N{\reng}-to torrential rains and floodings What is going on? -hurricane bearing down...
Dialogue: 0,1:23:55.08,1:23:58.17,Default,,0,0,0,,让百万家庭面对断电…\N{\reng}on the East Coast, leaving one million homes without power--
Dialogue: 0,1:24:00.54,1:24:02.84,Default,,0,0,0,,现在再加上我们一家\N{\reng}Make that a million and one.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:03.42,1:24:05.51,Default,,0,0,0,,我先去拿手电筒 小宝\N{\reng}I gotta get the flashlight, bubba.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:22.23,1:24:26.57,Default,,0,0,0,,我先留你活口 好让他能亲眼看你送命\N{\reng}I'm gonna leave you alive, so he can watch you die.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:35.20,1:24:36.45,Default,,0,0,0,,老爹\N{\reng}Dad!
Dialogue: 0,1:24:36.45,1:24:38.16,Default,,0,0,0,,- 汤姆 - 老爹\N{\reng}-Tom! -Dad!
Dialogue: 0,1:24:39.00,1:24:40.46,Default,,0,0,0,,汤姆\N{\reng}Tom!
Dialogue: 0,1:24:41.54,1:24:43.21,Default,,0,0,0,,不 老爹\N{\reng}No! Dad!
Dialogue: 0,1:24:43.21,1:24:44.46,Default,,0,0,0,,小亚瑟在哪\N{\reng}Where's Junior?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:46.67,1:24:48.76,Default,,0,0,0,,汤姆 不\N{\reng}No!
Dialogue: 0,1:24:49.63,1:24:50.68,Default,,0,0,0,,抱歉 儿子\N{\reng}I'm sorry, son.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:51.30,1:24:52.43,Default,,0,0,0,,小亚瑟在哪\N{\reng}Where's Junior?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:53.18,1:24:56.02,Default,,0,0,0,,黑蝠鲼…带走了小亚瑟\N{\reng}Manta... took Junior.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:56.72,1:24:58.56,Default,,0,0,0,,- 不 - 不\N{\reng}-No! -No!
Dialogue: 0,1:24:59.48,1:25:01.02,Default,,0,0,0,,不\N{\reng}No!
Dialogue: 0,1:25:56.87,1:25:58.87,Default,,0,0,0,,医务兵已将他的情况稳定下来\N{\reng}The medics have stabilized his condition.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:58.87,1:26:00.54,Default,,0,0,0,,他不会有事\N{\reng}He will be okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:00.54,1:26:02.08,Default,,0,0,0,,我们刚收到讯号\N{\reng}We just picked up a signal.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:02.08,1:26:06.63,Default,,0,0,0,,很微弱 是从古老亚特兰提斯 声纳频率上传来的\N{\reng}It's faint, but it's broadcasting on an old Atlantean sonar frequency.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:06.63,1:26:08.46,Default,,0,0,0,,并往南极洲移动\N{\reng}Headed to Antarctica.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:09.71,1:26:12.30,Default,,0,0,0,,- 去把小宝带回来 - 我会的\N{\reng}-Bring our little one back. -I will.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:13.88,1:26:16.14,Default,,0,0,0,,我曾梦想过此刻\N{\reng}I've dreamed of this.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:16.14,1:26:18.76,Default,,0,0,0,,有朝一日你们俩能兄弟相挺\N{\reng}The two of you standing together as brothers.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:22.69,1:26:24.77,Default,,0,0,0,,答应我你们会保护彼此\N{\reng}Promise me you will protect each other.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:28.11,1:26:29.94,Default,,0,0,0,,答应我 欧姆\N{\reng}Promise me, Orm.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:44.12,1:26:45.50,Default,,0,0,0,,去吧\N{\reng}Go.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:11.23,1:27:13.69,Default,,0,0,0,,好炫的出行工具 涅罗斯\N{\reng}Great waves, Nereus.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:13.69,1:27:17.87,Default,,0,0,0,,你的战舰很强大 但速度竟慢过海牛\N{\reng}Your warship is powerful, but it's slower than a sea cow.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:18.53,1:27:23.29,Default,,0,0,0,,依我看还不如甩掉这破烂 轻骑出行\N{\reng}I say we ditch all this dead weight and travel light. Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,1:27:23.29,1:27:25.79,Default,,0,0,0,,那敌方发射音波炮时要怎么办\N{\reng}And what are you gonna do when he turns on that sonic cannon?
Dialogue: 0,1:27:25.79,1:27:30.38,Default,,0,0,0,,我们唯一的胜算 就是用全方位压倒性的火力回击\N{\reng}Our only chance is to hit him with total overwhelming force from every direction.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:30.38,1:27:33.46,Default,,0,0,0,,- 不能让小亚瑟置身火线中 - 我们还有什么选择\N{\reng}-Not with Junior in the crossfire. -What choice do we have?
Dialogue: 0,1:27:33.46,1:27:35.55,Default,,0,0,0,,我们无法抵抗那种炮火\N{\reng}We have no defense against that cannon.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:35.55,1:27:37.01,Default,,0,0,0,,等等\N{\reng}Well, wait a minute.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:37.01,1:27:40.89,Default,,0,0,0,,这种武器会发射音波 并干扰神经系统 对吧\N{\reng}So this cannon sends out soundwaves that messes with our nervous system, right?
Dialogue: 0,1:27:40.89,1:27:43.85,Default,,0,0,0,,没错 是超音波回波\N{\reng}That's right. Ultrasonic echoes.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:43.85,1:27:45.48,Default,,0,0,0,,若我们发射同样频率的\N{\reng}Well, what if we disrupt those echoes
Dialogue: 0,1:27:45.48,1:27:47.35,Default,,0,0,0,,另一种音波来干扰回波\N{\reng}with another soundwave on the same frequency,
Dialogue: 0,1:27:47.35,1:27:49.52,Default,,0,0,0,,而且还更大声呢\N{\reng}but just much, much louder?
Dialogue: 0,1:27:49.52,1:27:51.57,Default,,0,0,0,,你想用魔法打败魔法\N{\reng}You wanna disrupt their disruption?
Dialogue: 0,1:27:52.23,1:27:53.65,Default,,0,0,0,,那会是容易的部分\N{\reng}Well, that's gonna be the easy part.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:54.78,1:27:56.78,Default,,0,0,0,,拿上你们的武器\N{\reng}Take your weapons.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:58.24,1:27:59.99,Default,,0,0,0,,准备好座骑\N{\reng}And ready your steeds.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:09.09,1:28:10.26,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯\N{\reng}Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:20.43,1:28:22.64,Default,,0,0,0,,他是真的不喜欢你 对吧\N{\reng}Really doesn't like you, does he?
Dialogue: 0,1:28:53.75,1:28:55.63,Default,,0,0,0,,我们原本进展不错 博士\N{\reng}We made a lot of progress, doc.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:55.63,1:28:57.92,Default,,0,0,0,,虽然他们在我们大功告成前毁了熔炉\N{\reng}They destroyed the furnace before we could finish the job,
Dialogue: 0,1:28:57.92,1:28:59.80,Default,,0,0,0,,但我们很接近了\N{\reng}but we were damn close.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:59.80,1:29:02.43,Default,,0,0,0,,只要再朝正确位置 射颗飞弹就能搞定一切\N{\reng}One well-placed missile should do the trick.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:05.18,1:29:06.85,Default,,0,0,0,,我的老天 我们做了什么\N{\reng}My God, what did we do?
Dialogue: 0,1:29:07.60,1:29:10.23,Default,,0,0,0,,反正这世界原本已开了头\N{\reng}Nothing the world wasn't already doing.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:10.23,1:29:12.98,Default,,0,0,0,,我们不过是让进程加快了几年\N{\reng}All we did was fast forward things a few years.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:12.98,1:29:16.48,Default,,0,0,0,,冰帽还没完全融化 但我们扫描发现了一个弱点\N{\reng}The ice hasn't fully melted yet, but our scanning reveals a weak spot.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:17.57,1:29:18.40,Default,,0,0,0,,这里\N{\reng}Here.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:18.40,1:29:21.03,Default,,0,0,0,,从这里能让你直达寇达斯\N{\reng}This will lead you straight to Kordax.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:22.91,1:29:24.53,Default,,0,0,0,,开启音波炮\N{\reng}Power up the sonic cannon.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:26.16,1:29:27.54,Default,,0,0,0,,带上那小鬼 着装\N{\reng}Bag the child and suit up.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:54.54,1:29:57.43,Default,,0,0,0,,呀\N{\reng}Yah!
Dialogue: 0,1:29:57.65,1:29:59.74,Default,,0,0,0,,队长 前方有多位敌军来袭\N{\reng}Captain, we have multiple incoming hostiles.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:01.53,1:30:02.82,Default,,0,0,0,,你们来得太迟了\N{\reng}You're too late.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:12.67,1:30:13.62,Default,,0,0,0,,等…\N{\reng}No.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:39.57,1:30:40.78,Default,,0,0,0,,开始充电\N{\reng}Commence charge.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:31.66,1:31:34.04,Default,,0,0,0,,你是开玩笑的吧\N{\reng}You've got to be kidding me.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:11.08,1:32:12.83,Default,,0,0,0,,太神奇了\N{\reng}Astounding.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:55.37,1:32:57.75,Default,,0,0,0,,这里太大了 可能藏在任何地方\N{\reng}This place is immense. It could be anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:57.75,1:33:00.33,Default,,0,0,0,,涅库斯的王座位于城市的中心\N{\reng}The throne of Necrus is in the heart of the city.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:00.33,1:33:02.71,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我感测到水中有东西 - 所有人 点亮照明\N{\reng}-I sense something in the water. -Everyone, light it up.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:07.88,1:33:12.60,Default,,0,0,0,,你不是说寇达斯把他的人民 都变成怪兽军团了吗\N{\reng}Didn't you say that Kordax turned his people into an army of monsters?
Dialogue: 0,1:33:12.60,1:33:14.56,Default,,0,0,0,,对 没错\N{\reng}Yes. I did.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:14.56,1:33:16.02,Default,,0,0,0,,眼睛睁大了\N{\reng}Keep your eyes open.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:16.64,1:33:19.35,Default,,0,0,0,,那很简单 反正我也闭不了眼\N{\reng}Well, that'll be easy. Mine don't close.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:19.89,1:33:22.10,Default,,0,0,0,,大家保持备战 前方有东西逼近\N{\reng}Everyone stand ready. Something's coming.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:27.03,1:33:28.57,Default,,0,0,0,,自由开火\N{\reng}Fire at will!
Dialogue: 0,1:33:44.04,1:33:45.50,Default,,0,0,0,,我们得找方法离开此处\N{\reng}I think this goes
Dialogue: 0,1:33:46.13,1:33:47.34,Default,,0,0,0,,从这里应该能一路穿过去\N{\reng}all the way through.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:47.34,1:33:49.84,Default,,0,0,0,,我的军队能对付这些虾兵蟹将\N{\reng}My men and I can deal with these worms.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:50.51,1:33:52.72,Default,,0,0,0,,你快去吧 把王子救回来\N{\reng}Go now and save the prince.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:53.47,1:33:54.85,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢你 殿下\N{\reng}Thank you, Your Highness.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:57.22,1:33:59.31,Default,,0,0,0,,来啊 你们这些软脚虾\N{\reng}Come on, you spineless worms!
Dialogue: 0,1:33:59.93,1:34:01.23,Default,,0,0,0,,放马过来\N{\reng}Bring it on!
Dialogue: 0,1:35:10.17,1:35:11.26,Default,,0,0,0,,帮帮我\N{\reng}Help me!
Dialogue: 0,1:36:14.40,1:36:16.20,Default,,0,0,0,,把孩子给我\N{\reng}Give me the child.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:09.75,1:37:13.88,Default,,0,0,0,,你挑错日子良心发现了 博士\N{\reng}You picked the wrong day to grow a spine, doc.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:17.55,1:37:19.01,Default,,0,0,0,,快赶到吊闸后方\N{\reng}Get behind the portcullis!
Dialogue: 0,1:37:20.22,1:37:22.01,Default,,0,0,0,,我们需要关闭闸门\N{\reng}We need to close the gate!
Dialogue: 0,1:37:59.97,1:38:02.43,Default,,0,0,0,,离我儿子远点\N{\reng}Get away from my son!
Dialogue: 0,1:38:03.14,1:38:06.47,Default,,0,0,0,,反正用你的血也行\N{\reng}Your blood will do just fine.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:07.93,1:38:10.68,Default,,0,0,0,,你想要血 就自己来取\N{\reng}You want blood? Come get it!
Dialogue: 0,1:38:24.99,1:38:26.45,Default,,0,0,0,,海王\N{\reng}Aquaman!
Dialogue: 0,1:39:00.28,1:39:01.84,Default,,0,0,0,,哦\N{\reng}Oh!
Dialogue: 0,1:39:14.83,1:39:18.59,Default,,0,0,0,,你身穿我哥的盔甲 手拿他的三叉戟\N{\reng}You wear my brother's armor, and wield his trident,
Dialogue: 0,1:39:18.59,1:39:21.51,Default,,0,0,0,,但你连他的一半都比不上\N{\reng}but you're only half the man he was.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:22.84,1:39:24.34,Default,,0,0,0,,真可悲\N{\reng}How pathetic.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:38.86,1:39:39.98,Default,,0,0,0,,梅拉\N{\reng}Mera!
Dialogue: 0,1:39:55.62,1:39:56.54,Default,,0,0,0,,你先走\N{\reng}Go!
Dialogue: 0,1:40:11.06,1:40:12.14,Default,,0,0,0,,梅拉\N{\reng}Mera...
Dialogue: 0,1:40:14.14,1:40:15.14,Default,,0,0,0,,快逃\N{\reng}Run!
Dialogue: 0,1:40:19.06,1:40:21.36,Default,,0,0,0,,将我从监禁中释放\N{\reng}Free me from my prison,
Dialogue: 0,1:40:21.36,1:40:26.70,Default,,0,0,0,,我的所有力量就会为你所用\N{\reng}and all my power will be yours to wield as you desire.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:02.77,1:41:07.28,Default,,0,0,0,,杀了他 你就能再度成为海洋领主\N{\reng}Kill him, and you will be Ocean Master again!
Dialogue: 0,1:41:14.37,1:41:17.66,Default,,0,0,0,,不错 现在这样终于好一点了\N{\reng}Well, now this is certainly an improvement.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:18.16,1:41:20.46,Default,,0,0,0,,强大的亚特兰提斯身躯\N{\reng}Powerful, Atlantean body.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:20.46,1:41:24.04,Default,,0,0,0,,而且这个人比之前那个更恨你\N{\reng}And this one hates you more than the other one did.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:24.04,1:41:26.63,Default,,0,0,0,,你说谎 别这样 小弟 我知道你听得见我\N{\reng}It's not true. Come on, little brother.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:26.63,1:41:29.22,Default,,0,0,0,,你看不出来吗 你赢不了的\N{\reng}I know you're in there. Don't you see? You can't win.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:29.72,1:41:32.60,Default,,0,0,0,,你不是杀死你弟 就是等着自己受死\N{\reng}Either you kill your brother or you die.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:47.82,1:41:52.49,Default,,0,0,0,,凭藉亚特兰的血脉 魔咒终被破解\N{\reng}By an Atlan's blood, this magic is broken.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:05.80,1:42:09.01,Default,,0,0,0,,我的永夜已结束\N{\reng}My eternal night is ending.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:16.43,1:42:18.97,Default,,0,0,0,,我受够跟你的傀儡对打了 寇达斯\N{\reng}I'm done fighting your puppets, Kordax.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:20.18,1:42:22.06,Default,,0,0,0,,我要跟你对干\N{\reng}I'm coming for you.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:25.19,1:42:26.32,Default,,0,0,0,,- 给我 - 不要\N{\reng}-Give it to me! -No!
Dialogue: 0,1:42:26.32,1:42:28.73,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我能了结这一切 - 别让他夺走一切\N{\reng}I can end this.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:28.73,1:42:31.32,Default,,0,0,0,,难道他抢走的还不够多吗\N{\reng}Don't let him take it! Hasn't he taken enough already?
Dialogue: 0,1:42:32.95,1:42:34.24,Default,,0,0,0,,放弃王位\N{\reng}Yield the throne.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:34.24,1:42:37.79,Default,,0,0,0,,是时候让我重新承启天命了\N{\reng}It's time for me to reclaim my destiny.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:37.79,1:42:40.70,Default,,0,0,0,,认为他能改变的想法实在太傻了\N{\reng}It would be foolish to think he could ever change.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:40.70,1:42:42.29,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道你会做到\N{\reng}I knew you would do this.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:42.71,1:42:44.50,Default,,0,0,0,,你才是独一无二的真正王者\N{\reng}You are the one true king.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:44.50,1:42:48.05,Default,,0,0,0,,亚特兰提斯值得拥有真正的王者\N{\reng}Atlantis deserves its one true king.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:50.38,1:42:54.30,Default,,0,0,0,,我才是独一无二的真正王者\N{\reng}I am the one true king!
Dialogue: 0,1:43:01.93,1:43:05.19,Default,,0,0,0,,你知道 我曾经有一度非常想见你\N{\reng}You know, there was a time when I wanted to meet you more than anything.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:05.98,1:43:09.57,Default,,0,0,0,,想让你知道你并不孤单 我俩能互相扶持\N{\reng}Let you know that you weren't alone,
Dialogue: 0,1:43:09.57,1:43:11.78,Default,,0,0,0,,答应我 你俩会保护彼此\N{\reng}that we were in it together. Promise me you'll protect each other.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:16.99,1:43:20.66,Default,,0,0,0,,来吧 小弟 让我们一起了结这个混蛋\N{\reng}Come on, little brother, let's end this bastard.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:21.12,1:43:23.54,Default,,0,0,0,,我俩第一次见面时 我说的都是真心话\N{\reng}I meant what I said when I first met you.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:24.00,1:43:26.13,Default,,0,0,0,,无论如何 你都不孤单\N{\reng}No matter what, you are not alone.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:26.79,1:43:28.09,Default,,0,0,0,,我俩可以一起承担\N{\reng}We're in this together.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:31.67,1:43:33.01,Default,,0,0,0,,你是我的兄弟\N{\reng}You are my brother.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:38.60,1:43:39.51,Default,,0,0,0,,欧姆\N{\reng}Orm.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:42.60,1:43:44.10,Default,,0,0,0,,放手吧\N{\reng}Let go.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:58.41,1:44:00.33,Default,,0,0,0,,欧姆 放手吧\N{\reng}Orm, let it go.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:19.35,1:44:22.10,Default,,0,0,0,,我终于重生了\N{\reng}I live again!
Dialogue: 0,1:44:22.72,1:44:28.31,Default,,0,0,0,,为了此刻 我在黑暗中苦等数世纪\N{\reng}I have waited countless centuries in the dark for this moment.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:34.53,1:44:35.74,Default,,0,0,0,,糟糕\N{\reng}Shit.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:43.41,1:44:44.66,Default,,0,0,0,,亚瑟\N{\reng}Arthur!
Dialogue: 0,1:46:11.08,1:46:12.50,Default,,0,0,0,,绝不\N{\reng}Never.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:20.67,1:46:23.39,Default,,0,0,0,,亚瑟 我们得走了 魔咒已经崩解\N{\reng}Arthur, we've gotta go. The magic is broken.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:38.57,1:46:39.69,Default,,0,0,0,,我们快闪吧\N{\reng}Let's get outta here!
Dialogue: 0,1:46:52.12,1:46:53.29,Default,,0,0,0,,快点\N{\reng}Hurry!
Dialogue: 0,1:46:58.88,1:46:59.80,Default,,0,0,0,,没错\N{\reng}That's right!
Dialogue: 0,1:46:59.80,1:47:01.42,Default,,0,0,0,,来吧 宝贝 好耶\N{\reng}Come on, baby! Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,1:47:17.40,1:47:18.23,Default,,0,0,0,,好耶\N{\reng}Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,1:47:38.79,1:47:39.80,Default,,0,0,0,,吾爱\N{\reng}My love.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:42.67,1:47:43.88,Default,,0,0,0,,嗨 儿子\N{\reng}Hi, baby boy.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:53.52,1:47:54.39,Default,,0,0,0,,老沈\N{\reng}Shin.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:55.35,1:47:56.35,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢你\N{\reng}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:02.90,1:48:04.45,Default,,0,0,0,,太神奇了\N{\reng}Astounding.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:09.74,1:48:12.45,Default,,0,0,0,,看来大家都全身而退 很好 很好\N{\reng}All here looking intact. That's good. That's good.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:12.87,1:48:16.08,Default,,0,0,0,,但我没有 我的螯足被砍断了\N{\reng}Well, I'm not. My claw got cut off.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:16.08,1:48:17.46,Default,,0,0,0,,还是第二次\N{\reng}Again!
Dialogue: 0,1:48:18.50,1:48:20.88,Default,,0,0,0,,你是最强悍的甲壳纲动物 殿下\N{\reng}You're one tough crustacean, Your Highness.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:21.75,1:48:24.13,Default,,0,0,0,,依我来看 你的前罪已清\N{\reng}Bah! As far as I'm concerned, your debt is paid.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:25.55,1:48:27.38,Default,,0,0,0,,但不是所有人都会同意这点\N{\reng}Not everybody's gonna see it that way though.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:32.26,1:48:34.73,Default,,0,0,0,,真可惜你在战斗中不幸丧生了\N{\reng}It's too bad you went and had yourself killed back there.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:36.77,1:48:37.77,Default,,0,0,0,,对\N{\reng}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:37.77,1:48:39.65,Default,,0,0,0,,这么多浮冰\N{\reng}All this ice.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:40.69,1:48:42.82,Default,,0,0,0,,要找到尸体可不容易\N{\reng}It'd be impossible to find the body.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:44.57,1:48:45.86,Default,,0,0,0,,先低调一阵子\N{\reng}Just lay low for a while.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:46.28,1:48:47.78,Default,,0,0,0,,但别跑太远\N{\reng}But don't go too far.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:48.20,1:48:50.20,Default,,0,0,0,,我可能会需要你的辅佐\N{\reng}I may need to call you up for some advice.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:50.20,1:48:53.16,Default,,0,0,0,,像是如何管理王国那类的事\N{\reng}You know, with the whole running the kingdom thing.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:59.21,1:49:00.33,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢你\N{\reng}Thank you...
Dialogue: 0,1:49:02.17,1:49:03.75,Default,,0,0,0,,大哥\N{\reng}brother.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:18.89,1:49:20.98,Default,,0,0,0,,你比你自己想像中做得好多了\N{\reng}You're not as bad at this as you think.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:22.82,1:49:25.57,Default,,0,0,0,,亚特兰提斯的人民很幸运能够拥有你\N{\reng}The people of Atlantis are lucky to have you.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:26.86,1:49:28.65,Default,,0,0,0,,你弥补了我所有的不足\N{\reng}You are everything I was not.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:28.65,1:49:31.74,Default,,0,0,0,,就算前景再困难 你仍能坚持正道\N{\reng}You do the right thing when doing the wrong thing is much easier.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:33.12,1:49:37.66,Default,,0,0,0,,你也愿意向往日宿敌开口求助\N{\reng}And you're willing to ask for help even from your worst enemy.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:39.50,1:49:42.38,Default,,0,0,0,,虽然有时你感觉不知道自己在做什么\N{\reng}I know it may not feel like you know what you're doing sometimes, but...
Dialogue: 0,1:49:42.38,1:49:44.25,Default,,0,0,0,,但请继续信任自己的直觉\N{\reng}keep trusting your instincts.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:45.00,1:49:48.47,Default,,0,0,0,,若你起身领导 亚特兰提斯必将跟随\N{\reng}If you lead, Atlantis will follow.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:51.26,1:49:54.60,Default,,0,0,0,,毕竟真正的王者会搭建桥梁\N{\reng}After all, a true king builds bridges, right?
Dialogue: 0,1:49:55.89,1:49:57.85,Default,,0,0,0,,我以为那只是个隐喻\N{\reng}I thought that was just a metaphor.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:00.23,1:50:05.07,Default,,0,0,0,,但你的隐喻刚刚拯救了全世界\N{\reng}Well, your metaphor might have just saved the world's ass.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:29.22,1:50:30.55,Default,,0,0,0,,刚刚传来即时新闻\N{\reng}We've got breaking news.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:30.55,1:50:31.88,Default,,0,0,0,,今日我们见证了历史\N{\reng}We are witnessing history.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:31.88,1:50:34.35,Default,,0,0,0,,其所带来的后果是…\N{\reng}A moment the ramifications of which simply...
Dialogue: 0,1:50:34.35,1:50:35.39,Default,,0,0,0,,无论如何强调都不为过\N{\reng}cannot be overstated.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:38.39,1:50:39.48,Default,,0,0,0,,海底王国\N{\reng}A first contact...
Dialogue: 0,1:50:39.48,1:50:41.06,Default,,0,0,0,,亚特兰提斯首度主动现身\N{\reng}...with the undersea nation of Atlantis.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:41.06,1:50:45.31,Default,,0,0,0,,一个隐身数千年的文明即将解密\N{\reng}An entire civilization hidden for thousands of years about to be revealed
Dialogue: 0,1:50:51.78,1:50:54.53,Default,,0,0,0,,可以说世界从此将大为不同\N{\reng}I think it's safe to say
Dialogue: 0,1:50:54.53,1:50:56.91,Default,,0,0,0,,亚特兰提斯之王联系了联合国\N{\reng}the world will never be the same. The King of Atlantis
Dialogue: 0,1:50:56.91,1:50:58.99,Default,,0,0,0,,正式请求成为会员国\N{\reng}has reached out to the United Nations
Dialogue: 0,1:50:58.99,1:51:02.21,Default,,0,0,0,,并有望提出共同努力方案 来扭转气候问题\N{\reng}and will be officially seeking membership. And is expected to propose a joint effort
Dialogue: 0,1:51:02.21,1:51:05.46,Default,,0,0,0,,据说这是与联合国在历经数周\N{\reng}to reverse the climate issues. We are told that this was the result
Dialogue: 0,1:51:05.46,1:51:08.42,Default,,0,0,0,,- 密谈后的结果 - 本台将与艾力斯岛连线\N{\reng}-of weeks of secret negotiations with the United Nations. -We now go live to Ellis Island,
Dialogue: 0,1:51:08.42,1:51:10.42,Default,,0,0,0,,直播亚特兰提斯的首位官方大使\N{\reng}where the first official ambassador from Atlantis
Dialogue: 0,1:51:10.42,1:51:12.47,Default,,0,0,0,,在联合国所发表的谈话\N{\reng}is about to address the United Nations.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:21.64,1:51:24.56,Default,,0,0,0,,今天我身为两个世界的代表来此\N{\reng}I come here today as a representative of two worlds.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:25.19,1:51:27.61,Default,,0,0,0,,陆地与海洋\N{\reng}The land and the sea.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:31.19,1:51:35.49,Default,,0,0,0,,我来到这里证明了两地都将迎来改变\N{\reng}And I stand here as proof that change is coming to both.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:35.95,1:51:40.08,Default,,0,0,0,,为应对全球危机我呼吁全球合作\N{\reng}And I'm calling for global unity for a global crisis.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:41.33,1:51:45.29,Default,,0,0,0,,好推进两地之间的和谐 以及我们世界的自然平衡\N{\reng}To finally bring harmony between us and the natural balance of our world.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:46.46,1:51:50.71,Default,,0,0,0,,亚特兰提斯随时准备提供协助 贡献我方的科学与技术\N{\reng}Atlantis stands ready to help contribute its science and technology.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:50.71,1:51:54.22,Default,,0,0,0,,凭藉你们对大气的了解 以及我们对海洋的了解\N{\reng}And with your knowledge of the air, and our knowledge of the seas,
Dialogue: 0,1:51:54.88,1:51:56.84,Default,,0,0,0,,我们可以一起写下彼此故事的下一章\N{\reng}together we can write the next chapter in our story,
Dialogue: 0,1:51:57.60,1:51:59.01,Default,,0,0,0,,而不是结局\N{\reng}rather than its ending.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:00.01,1:52:03.06,Default,,0,0,0,,有时我们的分歧会看似太过极端\N{\reng}Sometimes it's gonna seem like our differences are too extreme,
Dialogue: 0,1:52:03.56,1:52:05.73,Default,,0,0,0,,但我们只需要扪心自问\N{\reng}but all we have to do is look beneath the surface,
Dialogue: 0,1:52:07.06,1:52:10.98,Default,,0,0,0,,并了解到我们同在此星球上 更有着相同的目标和远景\N{\reng}to see that we're all here on this planet with the same goals and aspirations.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:11.36,1:52:12.78,Default,,0,0,0,,- 即便两方的风俗 - 给你\N{\reng}-Even when our customs... -Here you go.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:12.78,1:52:15.36,Default,,0,0,0,,- 是如此迥异与陌生 - 啤酒与起司汉堡\N{\reng}-might seem strange and unfamiliar. -Beer and a cheeseburger.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:15.36,1:52:17.45,Default,,0,0,0,,像你要求的那样额外多汁\N{\reng}Extra greasy like you asked for.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:19.28,1:52:21.70,Default,,0,0,0,,但透过克服我们的偏见\N{\reng}And by overcoming our prejudices,
Dialogue: 0,1:52:21.70,1:52:24.29,Default,,0,0,0,,我们会变得更加强大 并更为了解我们自己\N{\reng}we'll become stronger and learn more about ourselves.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:25.41,1:52:28.79,Default,,0,0,0,,我们可以抓住此契机 为了我们的孩子与家庭\N{\reng}We can seize this moment to create a better more hopeful future,
Dialogue: 0,1:52:29.17,1:52:32.25,Default,,0,0,0,,创造更美好并更有希望的未来\N{\reng}for our children, and our families.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:34.09,1:52:35.76,Default,,0,0,0,,我的名字是亚瑟·库瑞\N{\reng}My name is Arthur Curry.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:36.05,1:52:39.55,Default,,0,0,0,,我是海底王国亚特兰提斯的法定君主\N{\reng}I'm the rightful sovereign of the undersea nation of Atlantis.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:39.55,1:52:41.60,Default,,0,0,0,,我是一位父亲、兄长\N{\reng}I'm a father, a brother,
Dialogue: 0,1:52:41.60,1:52:44.27,Default,,0,0,0,,战士 与友人\N{\reng}a warrior and a friend.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:45.43,1:52:47.44,Default,,0,0,0,,我是亚特兰提斯之王\N{\reng}I'm the King of Atlantis.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:48.90,1:52:50.44,Default,,0,0,0,,我是海王\N{\reng}I am Aquaman.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:30.53,1:55:31.70,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯\N{\reng}Mmm.
